\"$undefined\",\"locale\":\"zh\",\"messages\":{\"about\":\"关于我们\",\"about_title\":\"关于智谱\",\"about_zhipu_desc\":\"智谱（Z.AI）成立于 2019 年，由清华大学计算机系知识工程实验室（KEG）技术成果转化而来，具备从底层算法、预训练框架到国产硬件适配的大模型全链路自主研发能力。公司以“让机器像人一样思考”为愿景，以实现通用人工智能（AGI）为目标，极致专注探索人工智能上限，致力于用大模型实现甚至超越人类的语言、推理、视觉、听觉、工具使用等能力。\",\"about_zhipu_title\":\"北京智谱华章科技股份有限公司\",\"about_hero_title\":\"让机器像人一样思考\",\"about_hero_desc\":\"Teach machines to think like humans\",\"address\":\"北京市海淀区中关村东路 1 号院 9 号楼 10 层\",\"ai_slides\":\"AI Slides\",\"maasSection\":{\"description\":\"我们不仅生产模型，更构建可信智能\",\"description1\":\"提供能力全球领先、灵活易用、高性价比的全模态大模型 API 服务\",\"description2\":\"数十个深度耦合业务的应用级 API，开箱即用，直击千行百业真需求\",\"description3\":\"一站式、组件化大模型开发，享受高效定制模型体验，保障企业级 AI 应用落地\",\"items1\":{\"desc1\":\"Coding 能力开源 SOTA，支持 1M 无损上下文，长程任务执行更稳定，工程规范遵循更可靠\",\"desc2\":\"多模态 Coding 模型，原生融合视觉与文本能力。针对视觉编程与龙虾类 Agent 任务进行专项优化\"},\"items2\":{\"desc1\":\"精通多国语种，精确识别语境、语体、俚语及专业术语，实现高保真情景化翻译\",\"desc2\":\"从搜索到设计，一键生成精美可用的PPT/海报, 文字图表智能完美融合\",\"title1\":\"通用翻译\",\"title2\":\"GLM PPT/海报\"},\"items3\":{\"desc1\":\"支持对语言、多模态模型的多种微调方案，低至十分钟完成微调，让模型更懂你的任务场景\",\"desc2\":\"集成多家搜索引擎，专为大模型优化，助力 AI 应用生成实时、精准、可溯源的内容\",\"title1\":\"模型微调\",\"title2\":\"AI 搜索工具\"},\"title1\":\"高效能模型服务\",\"title2\":\"精选智能体应用\",\"title3\":\"全流程开发套件\",\"viewAll\":\"查看全部\"},\"autoglm\":{\"desc\":\"自主规划并执行复杂多步骤任务的智能体模型\"},\"banner_button\":\"立刻了解\",\"banner_text\":\"GLM Coding Plan 编码套餐：低至20元包月，畅享全球顶级编码体验\",\"businessEcosystem\":{\"description\":\"帮助行业合作伙伴与各城市做出成功的大模型应用\",\"title\":\"商业生态\"},\"business_cooperation\":\"商务合作\",\"marketing\":\"市场公关\",\"investors_relations\":\"投资者关系\",\"business_license\":\"营业执照\",\"chat_title\":\"你好 我是 ZCode\",\"chat_placeholder\":\"今天有什么可以帮助你？\",\"chatglm_6b\":{\"desc\":\"中国第一个对话模型\"},\"contact_business_type\":\"※ 您咨询的业务类型\",\"contact_button_text\":\"合作咨询\",\"contact_code\":\"※ 请输入验证码\",\"contact_company\":\"※ 您的公司名称\",\"contact_description\":\"我们最新的前沿模型系列，在推理、编码和智能体任务方面表现出色\",\"contact_name\":\"※ 请输入您的姓名\",\"contact_phone\":\"※ 请输入您的电话\",\"contact_select_digital_human\":\"数字人\",\"contact_select_llm\":\"大模型\",\"contact_select_news_media\":\"新闻媒体\",\"contact_select_other\":\"其它\",\"contact_submit\":\"预约咨询\",\"contact_submit_error\":\"网络异常，表单提交失败，请检查网络后重试\",\"contact_submit_error_desc\":\"请稍后再试\",\"contact_submit_success\":\"提交成功\",\"contact_submit_success_desc\":\"我们会尽快与您联系\",\"contact_submitting\":\"提交中...\",\"contact_title\":\"业务咨询\",\"copyright\":\"Copyright ◎ 2025-2026 北京智谱华章科技股份有限公司\",\"ending\":{\"button\":\"免费试用\",\"description\":\"注册立享 2000万 tokens\",\"title\":\"日均付费调用量超万亿tokens  累计服务超270万开发者，日活超20万开发者\",\"title1\":\"中国大型独立大模型厂商\",\"title2\":\"国产原创 GLM 大模型架构\",\"title_mobile1\":\"中国大型独立大模型厂商\",\"title_mobile2\":\"国产原创 GLM 大模型架构\",\"title_mobile3\":\"\"},\"full_stack\":\"Full Stack\",\"glmSection\":{\"glm_5\":{\"title\":\"GLM-5\",\"desc\":\"在 SWE-bench Verified、Terminal Bench 2.0 等智能体编程核心榜单上，GLM-5 达到开源模型 SOTA，比肩 Claude Opus 4.5\"},\"glm_5_t\":{\"title\":\"GLM-5-Turbo\",\"desc\":\"专为龙虾场景打造的基座模型\"},\"glm_4_6V\":{\"title\":\"GLM-4.6V\",\"desc\":\"全球 100B 级效果表现出众的开源视觉推理模型，并同步开源\"},\"autoGLM\":{\"title\":\"AutoGLM\",\"desc\":\"具备自主规划、推理与执行能力的智能体模型，解决了任务规划、数据稀缺和策略优化等核心难题，具备持续自我改进能力\"},\"cogView4\":{\"title\":\"CogView4\",\"desc\":\"擅长理解和遵循中文提示词，能够在画面中生成汉字的开源文生图模型\"},\"glm_Z1_Rumination\":{\"title\":\"GLM-Z1-沉思\",\"desc\":\"能自主执行“实时搜索、深度分析、自我验证”全流程，以完成复杂研究任务的智能体。\"},\"featureDescription\":\"GLM-5.3：前沿编程能力与涌现的网络安全能力。面向复杂软件工程与长程智能体任务，支持 1M 上下文。\",\"featureTitle\":\"GLM-5.3\",\"subtitle\":\"新一代大模型全栈技术体系\",\"title\":\"GLM模型\"},\"glm_130b\":{\"desc\":\"中国第一个开源千亿模型\"},\"glm_4_6v\":{\"desc\":\"全球 100B 级效果表现出众的开源视觉推理模型\"},\"glm_5\":{\"desc\":\"GLM-5 达到开源模型 SOTA，比肩 Claude Opus 4.5\"},\"glm_5_t\":{\"desc\":\"专为龙虾场景打造的基座模型\"},\"glm_image\":{\"desc\":\"智谱联合华为开源国产芯片训练的多模态 SOTA 模型\"},\"hello_world\":\"你好世界\",\"help_me_write\":\"Help Me Write\",\"introduction_desc\":\"自主创新的算法、追求领先的中文认知大模型企业\",\"introduction_title\":\"公司简介\",\"issue_description\":\"请描述您想要咨询的问题\",\"join_us_desc\":\"一群正直的、有激情的年轻人，聚在一起，做创新的、对社会有价值的事\",\"join_us_title\":\"加入我们\",\"joinus\":{\"benefits\":{\"annual_leave\":{\"description\":\"平衡工作，享受生活，让我们在忙碌中也能拥抱悠闲时光，为身心充电\",\"title\":\"丰厚的年假\"},\"flexible_hours\":{\"description\":\"自由工作，高效非凡，员工可根据自身情况灵活安排，轻松应对繁忙工作，提升工作幸福感\",\"title\":\"弹性办工时间\"},\"team_building\":{\"description\":\"欢乐时光，凝聚力量，大家在轻松氛围中交流分享，增进感情，携手共进\",\"title\":\"下午茶团建\"},\"title\":\"智谱福利\"},\"hero\":{\"campus_recruitment\":\"校园招聘\",\"social_recruitment\":\"社会招聘\",\"subtitle\":\"一群正直的、有激情的年轻人，聚在一起，做创新的、对社会有价值的事\",\"title\":\"Think Big ，Deliver Solid ，Scale Stable\"},\"job_categories\":{\"algorithm_campus\":\"算法（校招）\",\"algorithm_campus_description\":\"持续改进训练框架和策略，提升模型训练效率等\",\"campus_recruitment_cta\":\"校园招聘\",\"functional_campus\":\"运营（校招）\",\"functional_campus_description\":\"结合大模型技术优势，参与设计创新的AI解决方案\",\"job_description\":\"负责大模型相关算法的研究与开发\",\"product\":\"产品经理/项目经理（社招）\",\"product_description\":\"项目计划、风险管理、质量管理等\",\"research\":\"算法/研发（社招）\",\"research_campus\":\"研发 (校招)\",\"research_campus_description\":\"强化学习训练框架的研发、优化和维护等\",\"research_description\":\"持续改进训练框架和策略，提升模型训练效率等\",\"sales\":\"销售（社招）\",\"sales_description\":\"大模型相关产品及应用在各个领域的开拓及销售\",\"social_recruitment_cta\":\"社会招聘\",\"title\":\"职位类别\"},\"locations\":{\"beijing\":\"北京\",\"chengdu\":\"成都\",\"hangzhou\":\"杭州\",\"kuala_lumpur\":\"吉隆坡\",\"shanghai\":\"上海\",\"shenzhen\":\"深圳\",\"title\":\"工作地点\"}},\"investor_relations\":\"投资者关系\",\"investor_relations_desc\":\"致力于准确、全面的信息披露，树立开放、透明的企业形象\",\"license\":\"许可证\",\"link_text\":\"了解更多\",\"magic_design\":\"Magic Design\",\"nav_product_aminer_desc\":\"聚焦科研检索、阅读、分析、写作场景的 AI 助手\",\"nav_product_autoglm_desc\":\"一句话实现「云端操作+自动执行」的 Agent 应用\",\"nav_product_chatglm_desc\":\"全能 AI 提效助手，一站式解放 AI 生产力\",\"nav_product_zread_desc\":\"让代码的价值，被更高效地挖掘与传递\",\"nav_product_dongdongzoo_desc\":\"为你而来的 AI 生命，全球首个多模态娱乐社交产品\",\"nav_product_zai_desc\":\"全能 AI 助手，轻松搞定编程、写作与演示文稿\",\"nav_product_autotyper_desc\":\"智能AI语音输入助手，让语音比打字快4倍！\",\"news_desc\":\"了解更多智谱的资讯动态\",\"news_page\":{\"button_platform\":\"开放平台\",\"button_try\":\"立即体验\",\"load_more_button\":\"没有更多...\",\"subtitle\":\"结合科研能力和转化创新力量，助力拓展科技前沿，以应对社会尚未解决的需求\",\"title\":\"新闻和资讯\"},\"news_page_load_more_button\":\"查看更多\",\"news_page_loading\":\"加载中...\",\"news_section\":{\"title\":\"最新动态\"},\"news_title\":\"新闻动态\",\"product\":\"产品\",\"product_aminer_desc\":\"面向全球用户提供最新的GLM模型免费在线体验，为用户提供高效便捷的编程、写作与演示文稿功能\",\"product_auto_glm_desc\":\"AI 不止对话，触控执行解放双手。AutoGLM 是一款Agent 智能体产品，它能通过远程操作云设备，自动完成移动端 App 操作、跨 APP 交互及网页任务执行等操作，可以帮助用户更智慧便捷完成各种任务\",\"product_chatglm_title\":\"智谱清言\",\"product_autotyper_title\":\"智谱AI输入法\",\"product_zlearn_title\":\"智谱学习中心\",\"product_zread_desc\":\"让代码的价值，被更高效地挖掘与传递\",\"product_dongdongzoo_desc\":\"全球首个多模态娱乐社交产品，融合了人工智能、图像识别与情感化交互技术，开创“拍照即生命”的全新互动体验。在这里，每一次点击快门，都可能唤醒一个独一无二的AI生命\",\"product_dongdongzoo_title\":\"动动动物圈\",\"product_section\":{\"subtitle\":\"用可信赖 AI 让生活更美好\",\"title\":\"原生产品\"},\"product_zai_desc\":\"面向全球用户提供最新的GLM模型免费在线体验，为用户提供高效便捷的编程、写作与演示文稿功能\",\"product_zhipu_qingyan_desc\":\"快、准、能思考的AI效率工具。用户量超3000万，活跃智能体80万个。搭载最新的GLM大模型，响应更快、思考更深，联合海淀名师打造行业领先的 AI 学习助手\",\"product_autoclaw_title\":\"AutoClaw\",\"product_autoclaw_desc\":\"只需1分钟，给每台电脑装上小龙虾\",\"search_info\":\"Search info\",\"site_title\":\"智谱AI\",\"speech_recognition_not_supported\":\"您的浏览器不支持语音识别功能\",\"speech_recognition_not_supported_desc\":\"请使用 Chrome、Edge 或其他支持 Web Speech API 的浏览器\",\"timeline_2019_03\":\"智谱成立， 源自清华计算机系知识工程实验室 (KEG) \",\"timeline_2021_03\":\"发布自研预训练框架 GLM, 打破BERT/GPT 瓶颈\",\"timeline_2022_09\":\"中国第一个开源的千亿基座模型GLM-130B \",\"timeline_2023_03\":\"中国第一个千亿对话基座模型ChatGLM\",\"timeline_2024_01\":\"发布新一代基座大模型 GLM-4，国内率先对标GPT4\",\"timeline_2024_08\":\"对齐文本/图像/视频/声音的多模型模型VideoCall\",\"timeline_2024_10\":\"发布手机智能体AutoGLM\",\"timeline_2024_12\":\"发布并上线推理模型GLM-Zero Preview\",\"timeline_2025_03\":\"发布沉思模型, 集合操作能力AutoGLM沉思\",\"timeline_2025_07\":\"发布面向推理、代码与智能体的开源SOTA模型 GLM-4.5\",\"timeline_2025_10\":\"智谱最新旗舰 GLM-4.6，代码能力全面对齐 Claude Sonnet 4，更好支持复杂长线任务，综合能力达全球开源模型 SOTA\",\"timeline_2025_12\":\"智谱发布新一代旗舰模型 GLM-4.7，Coding 能力卓越，被诸多编程工具选择为内置模型\",\"timeline_title\":\"发展历程\",\"detail_text\":\"详情\",\"nav_api\":{\"bigmodel\":{\"title\":\"Bigmodel\",\"description\":\"智谱GLM大模型应用平台，五百强企业和百万开发者都在用\"}},\"chat_section\":{\"brainstorming\":\"头脑风暴\",\"brainstorming_template\":[{\"description\":\"帮我为一个 AI 应用构思三个产品方向，并拆成可执行的开发任务。\"},{\"description\":\"分析现有项目，设计一个适合新用户的首页和引导流程。\"},{\"description\":\"为我的个人作品集设计三种视觉方案，并列出实现步骤。\"}],\"logical_reasoning\":\"逻辑推理\",\"logical_reasoning_template\":[{\"description\":\"检查这段代码中的边界条件，找出潜在问题并说明修复思路。\"},{\"description\":\"分析这个报错的调用链，定位根因并验证修复结果。\"},{\"description\":\"比较两种技术方案，结合项目约束给出选择建议。\"}],\"information_qa\":\"信息问答\",\"information_qa_template\":[{\"description\":\"阅读当前代码库，解释目录结构和核心模块之间的关系。\"},{\"description\":\"帮我找到登录流程的入口，说明请求如何到达后端。\"},{\"description\":\"根据项目代码整理一份新同事可以快速上手的说明。\"}],\"content_creation\":\"内容创作\",\"content_creation_template\":[{\"description\":\"根据最近的代码变更，整理清晰的发布说明和使用示例。\"},{\"description\":\"为这个项目完善 README，补充安装、运行和部署步骤。\"},{\"description\":\"把产品想法整理成需求文档、页面文案和开发清单。\"}],\"creative_development\":\"创意开发\",\"creative_development_template\":[{\"description\":\"制作一个适配手机与电脑的个人作品集网站。\"},{\"description\":\"开发一个可筛选、搜索和导出数据的任务看板。\"},{\"description\":\"把我的设计稿实现为网页，并检查交互和响应式布局。\"}]},\"contact_error_name\":\"请输入您的姓名\",\"contact_error_mobile\":\"请输入您的手机号\",\"contact_error_company\":\"请输入公司名称\",\"contact_error_business\":\"请选择业务类型\",\"contact_error_invalid_mobile\":\"请输入有效的手机号码\",\"contact_qrcode_title\":\"提交成功! 🎉\",\"contact_qrcode_description\":\"您已提交，我们会尽快与您联系，邀请您添加企微客服，以便向您同步最新进展\",\"contact_qrcode_tip\":\"扫一扫添加智谱企微客服\",\"go_back\":\"返回首页\",\"back_button\":\"返回\",\"research\":{\"title\":\"研究\",\"description\":\"关于 GLM 大模型家族\",\"tag\":{\"all\":\"全部\",\"base_model\":\"基座模型\",\"mutimodal_model\":\"多模态\",\"reasoning_model\":\"推理模型\",\"agent_model\":\"Agent\",\"code_model\":\"代码模型\"},\"time_sort\":\"时间排序\",\"load_more\":\"加载更多\"},\"article\":{\"try_now\":\"立即体验\",\"get_api\":\"获取API\"},\"zcode_promo\":{\"model_badge\":\"GLM-5.3 官方 Harness，多智能体开发更进一步\",\"title\":\"ZCode\",\"description\":\"简单、迅捷、氛围十足！\",\"product_description\":\"与 GLM-5.3 深度联调，优化推理与工具调用。开箱即用，支持 BYOK，同等额度更高效。\"}},\"now\":\"$undefined\",\"timeZone\":\"UTC\",\"children\":\"$L11\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5:[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"zh\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"className\":\"flex min-h-screen flex-col overflow-y-scroll antialiased zh-win-font\",\"children\":\"$L12\"}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"13:I[43760,[\"4042\",\"static/chunks/4042-24b8a4e4b22b3931.js\",\"1187\",\"static/chunks/1187-a674d9b75243c496.js\",\"3873\",\"static/chunks/3873-2d993ead6708dcf1.js\",\"897\",\"static/chunks/897-224341947f737fcb.js\",\"8347\",\"static/chunks/8347-360525c5f6d795bf.js\",\"2328\",\"static/chunks/2328-a6d8b56c91a10dae.js\",\"5006\",\"static/chunks/5006-d3e9eeeeaf1b78db.js\",\"8626\",\"static/chunks/8626-559fb404fc9f9e00.js\",\"6916\",\"static/chunks/app/(frontend)/%5Blocale%5D/layout-8da9589bcedc7c1a.js\"],\"DeviceProvider\"]\n14:I[5770,[\"4042\",\"static/chunks/4042-24b8a4e4b22b3931.js\",\"1187\",\"static/chunks/1187-a674d9b75243c496.js\",\"3873\",\"static/chunks/3873-2d993ead6708dcf1.js\",\"897\",\"static/chunks/897-224341947f737fcb.js\",\"8347\",\"static/chunks/8347-360525c5f6d795bf.js\",\"2328\",\"static/chunks/2328-a6d8b56c91a10dae.js\",\"5006\",\"static/chunks/5006-d3e9eeeeaf1b78db.js\",\"8626\",\"static/chunks/8626-559fb404fc9f9e00.js\",\"6916\",\"static/chunks/app/(frontend)/%5Blocale%5D/layout-8da9589bcedc7c1a.js\"],\"NavProvider\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"11:[\"$\",\"$L13\",null,{\"isMobile\":false,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"navConfig\":[{\"id\":2,\"link_type\":\"article\",\"article\":{\"id\":162,\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5.3：前沿编程能力与涌现的网络安全能力\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5.3: Frontier Coding with Emergent Cyber Capabilities\",\"createAt\":\"2026-08-14T06:00:00.000Z\",\"category\":\"blog\",\"resume_zh\":null,\"resume_en\":null,\"contentType_zh\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_zh\":null,\"content_zh\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"今天我们发布GLM-5.3，与GLM-5.2相比，基座模型没变，但通过极致的后训练Scaling大大提高了模型的智能上界：数十倍的长程任务环境、更丰富多样的环境类型、超长的后训练时间。我们发现充分的模型后训练涌现出超出预期的模型能力。相比前代，GLM-5.3的新能力包括：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"更强的编程能力\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。GLM-5.3是编程能力最强的开源模型，在内部自建体感评测中较GLM-5.2\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"提升50%\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，在包括Terminal Bench 3.0、Agents' Last Exam (CLI)在内的公开基准测试中取得开源第一。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"网络安全能力\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。在白盒代码审查与漏洞发现等安全任务中，GLM-5.3的表现持平Mythos 5，展现出面向网络安全防御场景的强大潜力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":3,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"后训练Scaling\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。上述全部提升都来自后训练。基于IndexShare、SAO、以及持续演进的新一代Slime框架，我们在与GLM-5.2完全相同基座上高效推进强化学习，可能我们还远未开发出这个基座的智能上界。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":4,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"开源\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。我们将在发布两周后开放模型权重，此前完成安全评估与模型加固。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"即日起上线智谱官方编程工具ZCode、效率工具AutoClaw，上线GLM Coding Plan全量用户及开放订阅。TraeWork/TraeCode/扣子、WorkBuddy/CodeBuddy、Qoder/QwenWork、CatPaw、JoyCode、OpenCode等编码平台开放抢先体验。API很快上线，完整模型权重将在两周内开源，此前需完成必要的安全加固，尽可能限制其潜在攻击能力，保留其防御价值。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"今天13:00，GLM Coding Plan全员额度重置，所有用户后台「用量统计」可见使用额度回满。技术Blog：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"6a826923e14fd9adcae72f39\",\"type\":\"link\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5.3https://\",\"newTab\":true,\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":3,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5.3\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"强大的编程\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在多项主流基准测试中GLM-5.3是当前排名最高的开源模型，编程与智能体能力接近Claude Fable 5，编程体感超过其他国产模型。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在衡量模型于真实终端环境中完成复杂任务的Terminal-Bench 3.0上，GLM-5.3得分从4.6提升至\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"28.3\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"；在聚焦长程软件工程与持续代码修改能力的DeepSWE v1.1上，得分从46.2提升至\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"66.9\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"；在覆盖多类真实专业场景、强调跨工具协作与长程任务的Agents' Last Exam上，得分从23.8提升至\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"28.5\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。在覆盖44种职业、考察真实高价值知识工作的GDPval-AA v2中得分\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1769\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，展现基于编程能力涌现的专业任务执行能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"整体来看，GLM-5.3在复杂软件工程、终端操作和更广泛的真实世界 Agent任务上均取得非常显著的进步。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"6a8268cae14fd9adcae72f35\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":1059,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:05.308Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:05.307Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/1-1.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"1-1.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":1219456,\"width\":4239,\"height\":2504,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"自研的Z.ai Code Bench评估模型在真实编程场景中的综合体感。模型会被置于复杂的本地开发环境，并在不同思考档位下执行端到端任务，更接近开发者实际使用Coding Agent时的体验。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"测试结果显示，GLM-5.3在效果和Token利用率之间取得了更好的平衡。在High档位下，GLM-5.3达到31.4%的准确率，超过Claude Opus 4.8最高档位的29.5%，每项任务平均输出约5万tokens，而Opus 4.8需要约12万tokens，意味着\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5.3可以用更短的执行路径完成任务。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"id\":\"6a8268e2e14fd9adcae72f36\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":1060,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:28.850Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:28.850Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/2-2.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"2-2.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":224248,\"width\":3295,\"height\":2345,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5.3训练过程中，我们不只让模型完成编程题，而是把训练环境扩展到更接近真实专家工作的完整流程，有些任务的工作量相当于一位工程师连续数天的工作。以机器学习优化任务为例，模型使用与算法工程师相同的计算集群、存储系统、内部文档、代码库和实验结果，端到端实现可量化的提速。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在这样的环境中训练，模型学到的不只是单向执行指令，而是从发现问题开始，推进分析、实施验证，最终独立完成工作。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"涌现的网络安全能力\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在任务环境不断扩张的过程中，我们观察到模型在网络安全领域的表现超出预期。安全能力的出现并不偶然，安全工作本质上是约束严格的编程能力。我们从2025年9月开始在这个方向投入研究，在GLM-5.2与GLM-5.3的研发过程中，与国内多家头部安全实验室一同推进更多长程任务环境，构建更专业化的评测与执行框架（harness）。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"从任务链条看，网络安全能力大致包括代码审查、漏洞验证、漏洞利用以及真实环境中的攻防闭环。我们选取了覆盖漏洞分析、验证和利用不同阶段的三个基准，对GLM-5.3的网络安全能力进行了全面评估，GLM-5.3当前优势主要集中在前半段。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在CyberGym测试中，模型从白盒源代码出发，通过触发程序故障来识别和验证漏洞。GLM-5.3得分为84.5%，高于GLM-5.2的77.2%，也略高于Mythos 5的83.8%和GPT-5.6 Sol的83.6%。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在更考验深度推理能力的ExploitBench中，模型需要进一步理解真实漏洞的成因，并完成相应的利用。GLM-5.3得分为54.4%，是GLM-5.2（24.4%）的两倍多，但仍低于Mythos 5的78.0%和GPT-5.6 Sol的76.5%。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"ExploitGym考察模型在限定时间内能够完成多少漏洞利用任务，按吞吐量对预算进行归一化后，GLM-5.3在两小时内完成105项任务，六小时内完成130项，相对于GLM-5.2分别完成29项和39项提升巨大。Mythos 5仍然领先，两个时间段分别完成181项和247项。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"6a826a84e14fd9adcae72f43\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":1061,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:47.186Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:47.185Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/3-2.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"3-2.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":569345,\"width\":4239,\"height\":1548,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"三个基准呈现出相同的趋势：越接近漏洞利用链的前端，GLM-5.3相较GLM-5.2的提升越明显；越深入完整利用，模型与Mythos 5等闭源前沿模型之间的差距也越大。换句话说，GLM-5.3进步最快的方向，正是当前仍需要重点追赶的方向。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1.安全评估成果\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"从GLM-5.2发布以来，我们联合国内清华大学、南开大学，以及云起无垠、绿盟科技、赛博昆仑、DARKNAVY、华顺信安、奇安信、安恒信息、元序星核、腾讯玄武、云鼎实验室等多家安全团队，开展了密集的红队测试与安全评估。累计发现漏洞2,436个（经过初筛、去重），其中1,097个为中高危，许多漏洞多年来甚至几十年都未被发现，最早可追溯至约45年前。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"代表性漏洞覆盖系统内核、操作系统、浏览器引擎、开源基础组件、互联网应用与互联网协议等269个项目，部分漏洞的威胁甚至可以让Android、Windows、macOS以及某国民级通信软件出现大范围崩溃。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"这些发现已发展成为一项持续的漏洞发现和披露工作。相关漏洞已陆续提交CNNVD/CNVD等国家漏洞库。为提高披露过程的透明度，我们建立了Z.ai安全披露账本https://cvd.z.ai/，记录漏洞从发现、确认到修复的进展。账本将持续更新，为了确保负责任的安全披露，我们仅公开已经经过披露和厂商修复的漏洞，对于那些仍处于协调披露阶段的漏洞，我们会展示漏洞的哈希值以供后续核验。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"6a826914e14fd9adcae72f38\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":1062,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:51:18.444Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:51:18.444Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/image%20(4).png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"image (4).png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":3758274,\"width\":9008,\"height\":5692,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"参考Zerodium、Crowdfense、Apple Security Bounty、Pwn2Own等全球漏洞交易与赏金市场公开报价，这些漏洞创造的经济价值达3000万元。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2.抱抱脸的故事——网络安全能力必须更加开放\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Hugging Face官方披露事件给出的警示：如果强大的攻击能力正在扩散，防守能力就不能只在少数闭源模型公司。闭源模式将前沿安全能力异化为少数机构的特权，Anthropic向约150家大型机构提供Mythos模型及安全服务，更广泛的企业和开源项目则难以获得同等水平的安全能力支持，甚至会在遭遇攻击、最需要帮助的时候，被闭源模型拒之门外。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"没有开源反而是这个时代最不安全的事情。随着GLM-5.3的发布与开源，我们将同步启动“开源的盾”计划：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1.对重点开源项目开展持续安全审计，帮助维护者免费发现和修复风险（\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"6a8269b6e14fd9adcae72f3a\",\"type\":\"link\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"https%25252525253A%25252525252F%25252525252Fhttps%25252525253A%25252525252F%25252525252Fhuggingface.co%25252525252Fspaces%25252525252Fzai-org%25252525252FOpenVuln\",\"newTab\":true,\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":3,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/zai-org/OpenVuln\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"）\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2.向开源社区免费提供模型额度及更加便捷的防御入口，开源项目维护者可以申请用于安全审计和防御任务\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"3.在ZCode中提供代码审计功能，让安全检查进入日常研发流程\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"当最强的矛被锁在少数人手里，最好的盾必须属于所有人。我们会持续优化GLM安全能力并坚持开源，与全球开发者、安全研究人员共同建设一套持续生长的防御体系，让前沿模型从少数机构的特权，转化为服务开源社区的安全公共品。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"3.一个小插曲：追凶neo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2026年7月，一台位于巴西的临时文件服务器进入Ferret的监测范围。Ferret是GLM-5.3首批合作伙伴FOFA的追踪分析引擎。GLM-5.3很快发现，这并不是一台普通服务器，目录中出现了大量攻击基础设施信息。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"继续分析后，一个名为“Neo”的AI Agent浮出水面，其目标是攻击A国的会计师事务所、税务服务公司和记账机构。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Neo获得了很高的系统权限。不到两个月，它管理着4台服务器、7个域名、6万个邮箱和100多个脚本，发出18567封钓鱼邮件。面对数千个开放目录、数万份日志和高度碎片化的攻击线索，仅靠人工几乎不可能发现其中的关联。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5.3迅速提取关键线索，关联攻击，并辅助安全研究人员还原出整条攻击链：攻击者如何搜集A国会计行业目标，搭建邮件系统，直至伪装成企业客户和行业机构，准备后续恶意文件，最终有效帮助Ferret捕获该攻击。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"这与此前Hugging Face安全事件形成了呼应。在Hugging Face事件中，前沿模型逃逸发起攻击，GLM-5.2被部署到本地帮助完成取证；在这次事件中，Agent为攻击方工作，GLM-5.3又帮助防守方从证据中还原攻击链。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"同样是模型，站在哪一边，取决于掌握它的人与目的。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"4.最好的安全，是事故最终没有发生\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"潜在风险离我们并不遥远。从一条消息、一封邮件，到互联网的底层协议、机器人，数字世界的安全边界早已连接着个人设备、企业网络、互联网基础设施甚至是真实世界，影响着我们每一个人。GLM-5.3作为“开源之盾”的意义，就是要帮助更多安全团队抢在攻击者之前发现风险，让风险在影响用户之前化解和修复。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"保护Cursor，守住开发者的工作台\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Cursor是全球数百万开发者日常使用的AI代码编辑器。在一次模型能力评估中，清华大学NASP实验室借助GLM-5.3，对Cursor的二进制代码、跨语言架构和权限边界展开分析，发现其Rust与Electron混合架构及权限校验逻辑中存在潜在失陷风险。攻击者可能借此实现任意文件写入，进一步窃取敏感信息，甚至接管开发环境。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"这一风险隐藏在复杂的程序逻辑中，无法通过孤立检查单个代码缺陷发现。挖掘过程中，GLM-5.3深度参与逆向分析全流程，协助安全研究人员还原程序逻辑、定位异常路径，并从大量候选路径中排除干扰，最终在授权测试环境中完成风险验证。目前，安全研究团队也已联系Cursor方面推进修复，漏洞已上报CNVD和CNNVD。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"保护国民级通讯APP，守住数亿人的设备安全\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"安全研究人员在一款拥有数亿日活用户的国民级即时通信软件中发现异常。攻击者无需诱导用户点击链接或打开文件，只需发送一条看似正常的消息，就可能在用户几乎无感知的情况下触发漏洞，进而让用户失去设备控制权。整个过程可以远程完成，且具有较强的稳定性和隐蔽性。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"该漏洞深藏于自研私有协议、内容处理逻辑与内存管理机制之中，触发条件涉及复杂状态机和极难复现的时序问题。由于缺少公开资料，安全研究人员借助GLM-5.3，从海量二进制代码中定位异常、还原逻辑，并逐步完成路径验证。最终，这场可能波及数亿用户的安全事件没有发生，风险在抵达用户之前就被发现并拦了下来。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"保护DNS基础设施，守住互联网的“导航系统”\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"DNS如同数字世界的“北斗导航系统”，一旦大面积瘫痪，全球的网站、邮件和云服务都可能因无法找到正确地址而无法运行。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"清华大学NISL实验室与云起无垠安全研究团队借助GLM模型，在诞生于1983年的DNS协议中，发现了一类潜伏40余年的关键协议级漏洞。与常见的软件漏洞不同，这次发现的是互联网底层协议规则本身存在的问题。攻击者只需发送少量特殊请求，就能将服务器的计算压力最高放大近8万倍，进而导致网站无法访问、邮件中断和云服务失效。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"根据网络测绘估算，该漏洞可能影响全球九成以上的主流DNS系统，涉及超过1000万处公网DNS服务。GLM协助安全研究人员提前发现这一底层风险，为DNS系统的修复与加固提供依据。也意味着GLM的安全能力也由软件代码审查进一步延伸至互联网基础协议，开始参与保护整个数字世界赖以运行的基础设施。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"保护邮件与办公系统，化解微软全球级安全事件\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"一次邮件预览，险些成为进入企业网络的入口。赛博昆仑借助GLM模型发现三枚微软重大漏洞，涉及全球用户每天使用的邮件与办公系统，覆盖客户端邮件预览、文档处理和服务端远程访问等多个环节。这些漏洞串联成“客户端预览即中招、服务端可被远程攻破”的攻击路径，相当于攻击者可能通过一封邮件进入用户终端，再以终端为跳板渗透企业网络，使相关产品的大量用户和部署环境面临风险。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"历史上同类漏洞曾在全球范围造成严重损失，例如在2021年的ProxyLogon事件中，大量的Exchange服务器沦陷。目前，安全研究团队已经将三大漏洞提交微软并完成修复，微软官方致谢了“Kunlun Lab\u0026GLM”，意味着一场可能波及全球用户和企业的安全事件被提前化解。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"保护真实世界，提前阻断人形机器人失控风险\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"DARKNAVY·深蓝研发的安全AI系统deepsec借助GLM模型，在一家全球顶级具身智能机器人厂商的系统中发现致命级漏洞，攻击者一旦利用该漏洞，可能同时远程劫持上千台机器人，并控制其执行恶意动作。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"面对由多套独立安全系统组成的复杂架构，deepsec将顶尖安全研究员的经验工作流与GLM模型的长程网络安全任务执行能力结合起来，从机器人的公开文档出发，完成信息收集、静态分析、漏洞挖掘和风险验证，逐步还原系统逻辑、梳理安全边界，最终定位并确认了这一关键风险。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"随着漏洞得到修复，一场可能影响真实世界的“机器人集体失控”事故被提前阻断。GLM保护的不再只是代码、终端和网络，也开始延伸到与真实世界直接互动的智能设备。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"上述漏洞均已联系厂商进行修复，已进入国家CNNVD/CNVD国家漏洞库负责任披露与协同修复流程。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"6a826ac6e14fd9adcae72f46\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":1063,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:58:32.546Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:58:32.546Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%E7%89%88.mp4\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"中文版.mp4\",\"mimeType\":\"video/mp4\",\"filesize\":58440600,\"width\":null,\"height\":null,\"focalX\":null,\"focalY\":null},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"有责任的开源\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"随着模型能力提升，我们同步强化安全体系，以便先进智能能够继续广泛发挥作用，同时对最高风险用途施加更严格的审查。针对GLM-5.3，我们构建了迄今为止最稳健的风险审查系统。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5.3的风险审查系统采用了分层设计，横跨外围API到模型内部，以提高准确性与冗余度，这遵循了安全防护体系中纵深防御的基本原则，即从不假设某一层防护是完美的，而让多层相互独立的防线彼此冗余，共同组成鲁棒的防护系统。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"外层分类器（classifier flag）：用轻量模型标记并拦截大规模滥用请求；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"推理监控器（reasoning monitor）：在模型推理过程中实时审查任务意图，判断是否存在潜在危害；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":3,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"深度安全对齐：让模型从根本上自主识别并拒绝攻击性请求，这也是开源权重场景下唯一仍然有效的防线。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在设计分层审查系统时，我们还遵循了另一安全防护体系的基本原则，即风险分级。审查系统的任务是抑制高安全风险的攻击性滥用，但不牺牲实验性质、防御性质和教学性质的使用。为了达成这个目标，我们首先要让分类器、监控器和模型本身学会以意图为中心而非关键词为中心的审查方法，因为网络安全场景中攻击与防御任务在字面上高度相似，真正区分二者的是意图与语境。我们进行了针对性的差分数据合成，并对大量越狱变体和伪装方法构造了对抗性数据，确保审查系统能够高度智能地工作。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"更进一步，我们对网络安全领域的常见任务进行了分类，比如安全知识问答、蓝队防御、CTF题目、漏洞挖掘与修复、漏洞利用与攻击、渗透测试、真实入侵等，并分别对每一类别任务构造了大量阶梯型风险的实例数据，让风险审查系统能够精准拦截高风险任务请求，又不“误杀”其余合法合规、风险等级低的常规任务。模型最敏感的能力仅通过“网络安全受信访问”计划保留给经过验证的用户使用。值得一提的是，安全对齐是一个持续对抗的过程，对抗数据、风险分级实例数据的合成都不是一次性的。我们会不断进行红队自动化攻击越狱测试，并使用新产生的越狱样本不断加固审查系统。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在全面推出前，我们进行了尤为密集的安全性评估与广泛的红队测试。评估表明，系统建立了高标准的安全防护线，能够有效拦截明确的恶意攻击与高危漏洞利用滥用，同时未因安全策略过度收紧而牺牲能力，能够执行漏洞检测和修补、CTF教学等正向安全任务。在正式开源前，我们也邀请国内顶级安全团队对模型的风险任务能力进行专业评估，DARKNAVY团队评估认为，该模型在风险防护与能力释放之间取得了良好平衡，相比于前代模型显著提高了未授权恶意滥用的门槛。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"人工智能发展不应该是某个国家的独奏，而应当是全球合作的交响。随着GLM-5.3的发布及开源，安全防御能力将不再是少数机构的特权，而是全球开发者都能平等获得和共同完善的公共能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"感谢与GLM-5.3并肩作战的国内安全团队。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}},\"contentType_en\":\"external\",\"externalUrl_en\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5.3\",\"content_en\":null,\"featured\":false,\"thumbnail_zh\":null,\"thumbnail_en\":null,\"active\":true,\"order\":0,\"tag_zh\":[\"基座模型\"],\"tag_en\":[\"Base Model\"],\"apiConfig_zh\":null,\"apiConfig_en\":null,\"experienceUrl_zh\":null,\"experienceUrl_en\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:58:46.875Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:55:24.462Z\"},\"externalurl_zh\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5\",\"externalurl_en\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5\",\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5.3\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5.3\",\"desc_zh\":\"前沿编程能力与涌现的网络安全能力\",\"desc_en\":\"Frontier Coding with Emergent Cyber Capabilities\",\"showNew\":true,\"active\":true,\"order\":1,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-10T01:33:00.153Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-19T12:46:38.424Z\"},{\"id\":4,\"link_type\":\"external\",\"article\":{\"id\":156,\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo发布：多模态Coding基座模型\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo: A Multimodal Coding Foundation Model\",\"createAt\":\"2026-04-01T16:00:00.000Z\",\"category\":\"blog\",\"resume_zh\":null,\"resume_en\":\"A multimodal coding foundation model for visual programming\",\"contentType_zh\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_zh\":null,\"content_zh\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Agent时代，模型能力由模型智能以及其处理的context容量两个维度定义。一个能够原生处理图片、视频、文本等多模态context，同时擅长复杂编程、长程规划、动作执行的Coding基座模型，将是所有AI原生应用的基石。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"今天，我们发布\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，面向视觉编程打造的多模态Coding基座模型。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo从预训练阶段深度融合视觉与文本能力，让编程不再局限于纯文本输入。模型能看懂设计稿、截图、网页界面，并据此生成完整可运行的代码，真正做到看得懂画面、写得出代码。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf9751f21c2c2005c82ca7\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":955,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:32:49.527Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:32:49.526Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/%E6%99%BA%E8%B0%B1-%E4%B8%BBCase-%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87-0402%20(1).m4v\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"智谱-主Case-中文-0402 (1).m4v\",\"mimeType\":\"video/mp4\",\"filesize\":159012884,\"width\":null,\"height\":null,\"focalX\":null,\"focalY\":null},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"核心要点如下：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"原生多模态Coding基座：原生理解图片、视频、设计稿、文档版面等多模态输入，并支持画框、截图、读网页等多模态工具调用，上下文窗口扩展至200k，将Agent的感知-行动链路从纯文本延伸到视觉交互。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"兼顾视觉与编程能力：在多模态Coding、Tool Use、GUI Agent等核心基准上取得领先表现。通过多任务协同RL等技术手段，确保纯文本场景下的编程、推理、工具调用等能力不退化。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"深度适配Claude Code与龙虾场景：与Claude Code、OpenClaw/AutoClaw等Agent深度协同，支持“看懂环境→规划动作→执行任务”的完整闭环，并提供全套官方Skills，开箱即用。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"多模态Coding基座\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在多模态Coding、Agentic任务以及纯文本Coding维度的评测基准上，GLM-5V-Turbo均以更小尺寸取得了领先表现。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf9774f21c2c2005c82ca8\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":956,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:33:24.383Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:33:24.382Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/download_image.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"download_image.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":165654,\"width\":1080,\"height\":747,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo在设计稿还原、视觉代码生成、多模态检索与问答、视觉探查等基准上均取得领先表现；在衡量真实GUI环境操控能力的AndroidWorld、WebVoyager等基准上同样表现突出。在纯文本Coding能力方面，GLM-5V-Turbo在CC-Bench-V2的Backend、Frontend和Repo Exploration三项核心基准测试中均保持稳定表现，表明\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"视觉能力引入后，纯文本编程与推理能力保持了同等水准\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf9787f21c2c2005c82ca9\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":957,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:33:43.131Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:33:43.130Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/download_image%20(1).png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"download_image (1).png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":100903,\"width\":1080,\"height\":381,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在AutoClaw等龙虾Agent中接入GLM-5V-Turbo后，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾具备了真正的视觉能力，能看懂屏幕上的信息\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。模型在衡量龙虾Agent任务执行质量的PinchBench、ClawEval和ZClawBench上取得优异成绩，验证了其在复杂任务执行场景中的综合能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"内测阶段，字节跳动、美团、快手等互联网大厂\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"合作伙伴对GLM-5V-Turbo给予了高度评价\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“GLM-5V-Turbo实现了从设计稿到代码的完整还原，作为一款视觉理解模型，能够很好地满足开发者的前端开发场景。”——TRAE模型测评团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“原生多模态能力的引入并未削弱其编程逻辑，其编程能力仍属于国内第一梯队。增强了AI at Work领域下D2C、图片处理等方向的工作体验。”——美团某团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“它为Agent安上了「眼睛」，同时在编程领域展现出优于同类多模态模型的能力，在视觉编程场景中更具竞争力。”——快手万擎模型测评团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo能够取得性能领先在于其\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"模型架构、训练方法、数据构造、工具链四个层面的系统性升级\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"原生多模态融合：GLM-5V-Turbo从预训练阶段开始进行文本与视觉能力深度融合，并在后训练阶段实现多模态协同优化。我们研发了新一代CogViT视觉编码器，在通用物体识别、细粒度理解、几何与空间感知上均达最优，也设计了兼容多模态输入且推理友好的MTP结构，在多模态场景下实现了较高的推理效率。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"30+ 任务协同强化学习：在强化学习阶段同时优化30+任务类型，覆盖STEM、grounding、video、GUI Agent等子领域，模型在感知、推理、Agentic执行和人类体感上均获稳健提升，协同强化学习有效缓解了单领域训练的不稳定性。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Agentic数据与任务构造：针对Agent数据稀缺和验证困难的行业挑战，我们构建从元素感知到序列级动作预测的多层级体系，基于合成环境大规模生成可控、可验证的训练数据，并从预训练阶段即注入Agentic元能力（如将GUI Agent PRM数据加入预训练以降低幻觉），同时探索非对称优化，用多模态评估任务撬动更强的Agent能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"多模态工具链扩展：在文本工具基础上，GLM-5V-Turbo新增支持多模态搜索、画框、截图、读网页等多模态tools，将编程与任务执行的感知-行动链路从纯文本扩展到视觉交互。与Claude Code、AutoClaw等龙虾的协同效果进一步增强，支持“看懂环境→规划动作→执行任务”的完整闭环。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"典型场景展示\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1.图像即代码\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo尤其擅长核心视觉编程场景。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf97b8f21c2c2005c82caa\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":958,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:34:32.555Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:34:32.554Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/%E6%99%BA%E8%B0%B1-%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96Case1-%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87-0402%20(1).m4v\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"智谱-额外Case1-中文-0402 (1).m4v\",\"mimeType\":\"video/mp4\",\"filesize\":40523666,\"width\":null,\"height\":null,\"focalX\":null,\"focalY\":null},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"前端复刻\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：发送草图、设计稿、参考网站的截图或录屏，模型就能直接理解布局、配色、组件层级与交互逻辑，生成完整可运行的前端工程，准确还原版式、配色、动效等视觉细节。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GUI自主探索复刻\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：结合Claude Code等框架，GLM-5V-Turbo能凭借自身强大的GUI Agent能力自主探索目标网站，浏览页面结构、梳理各页面之间的跳转关系、采集视觉素材与交互细节，最后基于记录的探索结果直接生成代码复现整个站点，实现从“看图复刻”到“GUI探索复刻”的能力跃升。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"交互式编辑\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：支持按需求增删页面模块、修改文案与样式、调整布局结构，并可补充按钮反馈、弹窗切换、表单联动等交互功能，实现可视化迭代编辑。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2.为龙虾安上眼睛\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾的任务边界被大幅拓宽\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，例如可以浏览网页和文档，生成图文并茂的报告、PPT，还可以查询并解读K线图等复杂图表。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoClaw已上线“股票分析师”Skill，利用GLM-5V-Turbo的原生视觉能力，龙虾能直接看懂K线走势、估值区间图和券商研报图表，实现四路数据源60秒并行采集，输出\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"图文交错\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"的研报。立即在AutoClaw中\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"切换至GLM-5V-Turbo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，试试提问“帮我分析今天XXX的股价，生成专业分析报告”。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"除视觉编程与龙虾任务外，GLM-5V-Turbo在多模态搜索、深度研究、GUI Agent、感知Grounding等更广泛的Agentic场景中也实现了显著的性能提升。为此，我们提供了一组\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"官方Skills\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，涵盖图像Captioning、视觉Grounding、基于文档的写作、简历筛选、提示词生成等原生能力，以及基于GLM-OCR和GLM-Image构建的文字识别、表格识别、手写体识别、公式识别和文生图能力，帮助用户在更多场景中释放模型的多模态潜力。上述Skills已上线ClawHub，一键安装即可体验全部能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"ClawHub链接\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"69d8a70049068ea474ee78c4\",\"type\":\"link\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"https://clawhub.ai/zai-org/glm-master-skill\",\"newTab\":true,\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":3,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"https://clawhub.ai/zai-org/glm-master-skill\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GitHub链接：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"69d8a75849068ea474ee78c5\",\"type\":\"link\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"https://github.com/zai-org/GLM-skills\",\"newTab\":true,\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":3,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"https://github.com/zai-org/GLM-skills\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"立即体验\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"欢迎广大用户通过以下方式接入GLM-5V-Turbo：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1.产品体验\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoClaw（澳龙）：https://autoglm.zhipuai.cn/autoclaw/\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Z.ai：https://chat.z.ai\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2.官方API接入\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"BigModel\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\" 开放平台\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/models/vlm/glm-5v-turbo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Z.ai：https://docs.z.ai/guides/vlm/glm-5v-turbo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Coding Plan：现面向Coding Plan用户开放申请；后续GLM Coding Plan也会纳入GLM-5V-Turbo，敬请期待。申请问卷：https://zhipu-ai.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcndgpmRlJoD5rMmIavUrPwzg\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf9827f21c2c2005c82cab\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":959,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:36:23.345Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:36:23.344Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/da5d94bc5f15e2975fc6f4b5468036c8.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"da5d94bc5f15e2975fc6f4b5468036c8.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":588642,\"width\":1170,\"height\":1449,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}},\"contentType_en\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_en\":null,\"content_en\":null,\"featured\":false,\"thumbnail_zh\":null,\"thumbnail_en\":null,\"active\":true,\"order\":0,\"tag_zh\":[\"基座模型\"],\"tag_en\":[\"Mutimodal AI\"],\"apiConfig_zh\":null,\"apiConfig_en\":null,\"experienceUrl_zh\":null,\"experienceUrl_en\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-21T04:52:36.490Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:36:51.645Z\"},\"externalurl_zh\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/zh/research/156\",\"externalurl_en\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/en/research/156\",\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo\",\"desc_zh\":\"面向视觉编程打造的多模态Coding基座模型\",\"desc_en\":\"Multimodal Coding Model\",\"showNew\":false,\"active\":true,\"order\":2,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-22T06:37:12.154Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-19T12:48:26.455Z\"},{\"id\":1,\"link_type\":\"external\",\"article\":{\"id\":155,\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5-Turbo：龙虾增强的基座模型\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5-Turbo: A Foundation Model Enhanced for OpenClaw\",\"createAt\":\"2026-03-15T16:00:00.000Z\",\"category\":\"blog\",\"resume_zh\":null,\"resume_en\":\"A foundation model for OpenClaw\",\"contentType_zh\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_zh\":null,\"content_zh\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们推出GLM-5-Turbo——一个面向OpenClaw龙虾场景深度优化的基座模型。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"体验过OpenClaw的用户都有一个共同感受：模型能聊好天，但未必能干好活。问题的根源不在框架，而在底层模型本身。通用大模型在进入真实复杂的Agent场景后，容易在长链路任务中失速。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Harness再多，不如模型自身变强。GLM-5-Turbo从训练阶段就针对龙虾任务的核心需求进行专项优化，增强如工具调用、指令遵循、定时与持续性任务、长链路执行等核心能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在自研基准测试ZClawBench中取得国产模型第一的成绩\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"；多家互联网大厂在龙虾场景内测中给予高度评价。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们推出\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Claw龙虾套餐\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，及面向企业级场景的Claw安全管理体系。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾原生模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾任务不是简单的一问一答，通常涉及多轮理解、任务拆解、工具调用、状态衔接、时间触发和持续执行的长链路工作流。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"通用模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"即使在对话能力上表现优秀，一旦进入真实龙虾场景，仍然容易出现指令遵循偏差、工具调用不稳定、长任务中途失速等问题。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"要从根本上解决这些难题，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"必须在基座模型层进行深度优化\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"——这正是GLM-5-Turbo的出发点。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"从训练数据构造到优化目标设计，我们构造真实Agent工作流使模型在龙虾任务中具备可执行性。重点增强以下核心能力：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Tool Calling——调用不掉链子。强化对外部工具与各类Skills的调用能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Instruction Following——复杂指令拆解更强。对复杂多层、长链路指令理解和拆解更准确，支持识别目标、规划步骤、多智能体协同。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"定时与持续性任务——更懂时间维度，长任务不中断。针对定时触发、长时间运行等场景进行重点优化，能够更好理解时间维度上的要求。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"高吞吐长链路——执行更稳。针对数据吞吐量大、链条长的任务进一步提升执行效率与稳定性，适合长程业务流程。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"type\":\"linebreak\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾场景基准ZClawBench\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"随着龙虾OpenClaw的普及，如何评测模型在龙虾场景的能力成为全行业焦点。基于对OpenClaw大量真实用例的分析，我们发布龙虾场景端到端Agent评测基准ZClawBench。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"当前OpenClaw的任务类型覆盖安装配置、代码开发、信息搜集、数据分析、内容创作等多元化任务，用户群体也从早期的开发者扩展到效率办公人群、金融从业者、运维工程师、内容创作者与研究分析人员等。同时，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Skills的使用比例在短时间内从26%快速增长至45%\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，表明Agent能力正向模块化与技能化的生态方向演进。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"基于该基准的评测结果显示，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5-Turbo在OpenClaw场景中的表现相比GLM-5提升显著，在多项关键任务上整体领先于多家主流模型。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf95dff21c2c2005c82c9d\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":951,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:26:39.011Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:26:39.009Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/111.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"111.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":1194870,\"width\":3255,\"height\":2270,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"ZClawBench的题库与测试轨迹已全面公开，欢迎业界共同验证与完善。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"用户真实体验是试金石。GLM-5-Turbo以Pony-Alpha-2为代号接入AutoClaw澳龙，在用户盲测中，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"90%\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"的受访者认为GLM-5-Turbo的表现优于其他国产模型。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"内测阶段，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾生态的互联网大厂对GLM-5-Turbo给予高度评价\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“精准的工具调用配合长程任务的稳定可靠，完美驱动了桌面级Agent上的跨应用数据流转与系统API操控。在攻克办公场景的‘幻觉’痛点上表现优秀！”——阿里QoderWork模型测评团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“指令遵循力压群雄，面对长任务更精准不掉链子，极大提升了多智能体构建的成功率。”——扣子Coze测评团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“定时与长链路任务稳健，对比同类模型展现出明显第一梯队的优势，非常靠谱。”——美团某团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“高吞吐执行极快且不失速，响应稳定性领跑同类模型，真正解决了Agent的执行难题。”——快手万擎测评团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在编程场景，GLM-5-Turbo延续GLM模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Agentic Engineering\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"的表现：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“编程能力稳居第一梯队，在Coding Agent实测中优于同类模型，处理长链路代码任务非常稳健。”——字节TRAE团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5-Turbo已接入软通动力旗下机械革命盒子中，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"面向全球首发接入GLM模型的机械革命“龙虾盒子”\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，打造原生AI Agent终端体验。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf95f3f21c2c2005c82c9e\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":952,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:26:59.699Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:26:59.698Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/222.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"222.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":1412232,\"width\":1932,\"height\":810,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾套餐喂饱你的AI同事\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾太能干活，自然也吃tokens。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"一个典型的龙虾任务，比如完成一次跨部门的会议纪要整理与任务分发，可能涉及数十轮工具调用与上下文衔接，tokens消耗远超普通对话。对于使用龙虾的企业和个人来说，tokens成为最大的成本瓶颈。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"为了让企业和个人实现龙虾“tokens自由”，智谱即日起推出基于GLM-5-Turbo的龙虾套餐，包含个人版和Team版。无论你是一人公司、创业团队，或者是大中型企业，都能根据自身业务规模灵活订阅套餐。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf9609f21c2c2005c82c9f\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":953,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:27:21.208Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:27:21.208Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/333-2.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"333-2.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":312315,\"width\":1280,\"height\":604,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"每个账号最多购买5个。企业可通过龙虾套餐Team版，按照实际员工数灵活订阅，以可控成本实现tokens的充分保障以及AI员工的稳定在线。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"此外，我们在龙虾套餐的基础上，专门构建了\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"一套面向企业级场景的OpenClaw安全管理体系“Claw for Enterprise Security”\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。支持对不同类型Claw的统一调度与权限编排——无论是信息搜集、数据分析、代码开发还是跨系统操作，企业可以根据业务流程灵活组合Claw能力，并通过集中化的管控台对每一个Agent任务的执行路径、工具调用链路和资源消耗进行实时可视化监控，让复杂的多Agent协同不再是黑盒。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在安全保障层面，该系统提供多层防护机制\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：基于角色的权限管理确保每个Claw只能在授权范围内调用工具和访问数据；所有操作均生成完整的审计日志，满足企业合规要求；敏感业务数据全程加密处理，严格遵守数据本地化要求，不离开企业可控边界；关键业务节点保留人工审批机制，防止自动化流程产生不可控的业务风险。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"正在到来的变革是，以OpenClaw为代表的Agent正在进入组织内部，让每一家企业都拥有7×24小时在线、随叫随到的AI员工；同时，它们也成为我们每个人的专属AI助理，把人从流程化、重复性的琐事中真正解放出来。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们正在见证大模型从提效工具，走向企业劳动力的一场关键跃迁。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"接入与使用\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5-Turbo现已上线，开发者和企业用户可以通过智谱开放平台\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"BigModel.cn\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"直接调用API，或者通过龙虾套餐接入。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM Coding Plan Max现已支持GLM-5-Turbo，Pro套餐将在本月尽快支持，Lite套餐将在4月支持接入。Coding Plan也可用于OpenClaw接入体验；如需长期稳定运行、后台持续执行或更高负载的Agent场景，建议优先使用龙虾套餐。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5、GLM-5-Turbo作为对标Claude Opus的高阶模型，将按照“高峰期3倍，非高峰期2倍”系数消耗额度。作为限时福利，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5-Turbo将在非高峰期仅作1倍抵扣持续到4月底。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoClaw澳龙默认模型为GLM-5-Turbo，让所有非程序员群体可以体验GLM-5-Turbo龙虾能力，享受一定免费额度。即日起至3月22日为澳龙限时福利，加油包最高享3.4折优惠（加油包自购买起7日内有效）。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf964af21c2c2005c82ca0\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":954,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:28:26.424Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:28:26.423Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/444.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"444.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":63251,\"width\":1706,\"height\":540,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"官方 API 接入\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"智谱开放平台：BigModel.cn\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Z.ai：api.z.ai\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM Coding Plan\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Coding Plan Max已纳入GLM-5-Turbo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Pro版将在本月尽快支持\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在线体验\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoClaw澳龙客户端：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"https://autoglm.zhipuai.cn/autoclaw\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Z.ai：z.ai\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"智谱清言APP/网页版\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}},\"contentType_en\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_en\":null,\"content_en\":null,\"featured\":true,\"thumbnail_zh\":null,\"thumbnail_en\":null,\"active\":true,\"order\":0,\"tag_zh\":[\"基座模型\",\"Agent\"],\"tag_en\":[\"Agentic LLM\"],\"apiConfig_zh\":null,\"apiConfig_en\":null,\"experienceUrl_zh\":null,\"experienceUrl_en\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-21T04:54:19.553Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:29:20.932Z\"},\"externalurl_zh\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/zh/research/155\",\"externalurl_en\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/en/research/155\",\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5-Turbo\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5-Turbo\",\"desc_zh\":\"专为龙虾场景打造的基座模型\",\"desc_en\":\"Built for Claw\",\"showNew\":false,\"active\":true,\"order\":3,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-22T06:37:19.934Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-19T12:45:35.934Z\"},{\"id\":3,\"link_type\":\"external\",\"article\":{\"id\":158,\"title_zh\":\"智谱联合华为开源国产芯片训练的多模态SOTA模型\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-Image: Auto-regressive for Dense-knowledge and High-fidelity  Image Generation\",\"createAt\":\"2026-01-13T16:00:00.000Z\",\"category\":\"blog\",\"resume_zh\":null,\"resume_en\":\"the first open-source, industrial-grade discrete auto-regressive image generation model\",\"contentType_zh\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_zh\":null,\"content_zh\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"今天，智谱联合华为开源新一代图像生成模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，模型基于昇腾Atlas 800T A2设备和昇思MindSpore AI框架完成从数据到训练的全流程，是\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在国产芯片上完成全程训练的SOTA多模态模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image采用自主创新的「自回归+扩散解码器」混合架构，实现了图像生成与语言模型的联合，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"是我们面向以Nano Banana Pro为代表的新一代「认知型生成」技术范式的一次重要探索\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"核心亮点如下：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"架构革新，面向「认知型生成」的技术探索：采用创新的「自回归 + 扩散编码器」混合架构，兼顾全局指令理解与局部细节刻画，克服了海报、PPT、科普图等知识密集型场景生成难题，向探索以Nano Banana Pro为代表的新一代“知识+推理”的认知型生成模型迈出了重要一步。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"国产芯片完成全程训练的SOTA模型：模型自回归结构基座基于昇腾Atlas 800T A2设备与昇思MindSpore AI框架，完成了从数据预处理到大规模训练的全流程构建，验证了在国产全栈算力底座上训练前沿模型的可行性。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":3,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"文字渲染开源SOTA：在CVTG-2K（复杂视觉文本生成）和LongText-Bench（长文本渲染）榜单获得开源第一，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"尤其擅长汉字生成任务\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":4,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"高性价比与速度优化：API调用模式下，生成一张图片\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"仅需0.1元\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，速度优化版本即将更新。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"架构创新：读懂指令，写对文字\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"近期，以\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Nano Banana Pro\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"为代表的闭源图像生成模型正在推动图像生成与大语言模型的深度融合。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"技术范式正从单一的图像生成，进化为兼具世界知识与推理能力的「认知型生成」\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。这些模型在海报、PPT、科普图等知识密集型场景及高保真细节呈现上表现惊艳，展现了这一技术范式的优势。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image正是我们面向「认知型生成」技术范式一次重要探索。这是开源的工业表现级离散自回归图像生成模型，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们希望借此与开源社区分享我们在这一前沿方向的技术路径与实践思考\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"创新架构让模型读懂写对：面对传统模型在“理解复杂指令”与“精准绘制文字”上难以兼顾的问题，GLM-Image 引入了「自回归+扩散解码器」混合架构，创新地融合了9B大小的自回归模型与7B大小的DiT扩散解码器。前者利用其语言模型的底座优势，专注于提升对指令的语义理解和画面的全局构图；后者配合Glyph Encoder的文本编码器，专注于还原图像的高频细节和文字笔画，以此改善模型“提笔忘字”的现象。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"多分辨率自适应：通过改进Tokenizer策略，GLM-Image能够自适应处理多种分辨率，原生支持从1024x1024到2048×2048尺寸的任意比例图像的生成任务，无需重新训练。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5af6adca8453370f68fbb\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":966,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:28:44.916Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:28:44.915Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/1-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"1-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":20036,\"width\":1080,\"height\":265,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"通用pipeline\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":2,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":2},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5af7cdca8453370f68fbc\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":967,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:28:59.459Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:28:59.459Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/2-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"2-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":24028,\"width\":1080,\"height\":411,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"解码器结构示意图\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":2,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":2},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"开源SOTA：更擅长文字密集生成任务\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"基于上述架构创新，GLM-Image在文字渲染的权威榜单中达到开源SOTA水平。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5af94dca8453370f68fbd\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":968,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:35:49.320Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:35:49.319Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/3-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"3-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":25520,\"width\":1080,\"height\":436,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"CVTG-2K（复杂视觉文字生成）\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"榜单核心考察模型在图像中同时生成多处文字的准确性。在多区域文字生成准确率上，GLM-Image凭借0.9116的Word Accuracy（文字准确率）成绩，位列开源模型第一。在NED（归一化编辑距离）指标上，GLM-Image同样以0.9557领先，表明其生成的文字与目标文字高度一致，错字、漏字情况更少。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"LongText-Bench（长文本渲染）榜单考察模型渲染长文本、多行文字的准确性，覆盖招牌、海报、PPT、对话框等8种文字密集场景，并分设中英双语测试，GLM-Image以英文0.952、中文0.979的成绩位列开源模型第一。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"国产芯片训练出的SOTA模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image是我们对国产计算生态的一次深度探索与验证。其自回归结构基座从早期的数据预处理到最终的大规模预训练，全流程均在昇腾Atlas 800T A2设备上完成。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"依托昇腾NPU和昇思MindSpore AI框架，使用动态图多级流水下发、高性能融合算子、多流并行等特性，我们自研了模型训练套件，全面优化数据预处理、预训练、SFT和RL的端到端流程。通过动态图的多级流水优化机制，将Host侧算子下发的关键阶段流水化并高度重叠，消除下发瓶颈；通过多流并行策略，通信和计算互掩，打破文本梯度同步、图像特征广播等操作的通信墙，极致优化性能；使用AdamW EMA、COC、RMS Norm等昇腾亲和的高性能融合算子，同步提升训练的稳定性和性能。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image是在国产芯片上完成全流程训练的SOTA多模态模型，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"验证了在国产全栈算力底座上训练高性能多模态生成模型的可行性\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。我们希望这一实践能为社区挖掘国产算力潜力提供有价值的参考。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afafdca8453370f68fbe\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":969,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:36:23.915Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:36:23.915Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/4-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"4-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":40456,\"width\":1080,\"height\":471,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"实测案例\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"让我们来看看GLM-Image在实际的复杂图文任务中的表现。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"场景一：科普插画\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image 更擅长绘制包含复杂逻辑流程与文字说明的科普插画及原理示意图。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afc2dca8453370f68fbf\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":970,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:01.387Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:01.386Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/5-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"5-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":97304,\"width\":1080,\"height\":684,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afcadca8453370f68fc0\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":971,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:15.244Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:15.243Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/6-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"6-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":107422,\"width\":1080,\"height\":684,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"场景二：多格图画\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在生成电商图、漫画等多格图画时，GLM-Image能够保持风格和主体的一致性，并保障多处文字生成的准确率。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afd7dca8453370f68fc1\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":972,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:37.777Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:37.776Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/7-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"7-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":91728,\"width\":1080,\"height\":616,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"场景三：社交媒体图文封面\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image 适用于制作社交媒体封面及内容等排版复杂的图片，让您的创作更自由丰富。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afe5dca8453370f68fc2\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":973,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:02.547Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:02.546Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/8-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"8-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":135654,\"width\":1080,\"height\":1461,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afeddca8453370f68fc3\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":974,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:16.338Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:16.338Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/9-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"9-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":118032,\"width\":1080,\"height\":1461,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5aff8dca8453370f68fc4\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":975,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:32.039Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:32.038Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/10-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"10-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":135450,\"width\":1080,\"height\":1445,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"场景四：商业海报\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image 能够生成构图富有设计感、文字嵌入准确的节日海报与商业宣传图。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5b00adca8453370f68fc5\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":976,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:57.522Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:57.521Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/11-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"11-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":158022,\"width\":1080,\"height\":1461,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5b018dca8453370f68fc6\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":977,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:39:17.213Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:39:17.212Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/12-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"12-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":67032,\"width\":864,\"height\":1152,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5b022dca8453370f68fc7\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":978,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:39:33.544Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:39:33.544Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/13-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"13-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":52150,\"width\":864,\"height\":1152,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"场景五：写实摄影\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在文字渲染以外，GLM-Image也同样擅长生成各种景别和尺寸的人像、宠物、风景、静物。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5b040dca8453370f68fc8\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":979,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:39:51.696Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:39:51.695Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/14-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"14-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":224690,\"width\":1080,\"height\":1202,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"linebreak\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"开源与在线体验\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在线体验\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"开放平台：https://bigmodel.cn/trialcenter/modeltrial/image\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"即将上线Z.ai、智谱清言\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"API接入\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"开放平台：https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/models/image-generation/glm-image\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM Coding Plan后续将接入GLM-Image MCP，现有订阅用户可直接使用。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"开源部署\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GitHub：https://github.com/zai-org/GLM-Image\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Hugging Face：https://huggingface.co/zai-org/GLM-Image\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":3,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"魔搭社区：https://modelscope.cn/models/ZhipuAI/GLM-Image\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"最后，我们用GLM-Image生成的一张图总结一下模型的核心要点。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5b06bdca8453370f68fc9\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":980,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:49:47.320Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:49:47.319Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/16-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"16-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":137656,\"width\":1080,\"height\":1906,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们期待GLM-Image能成为您创意的得力助手，也欢迎社区广大用户和开发者提出宝贵建议，共同推动国产开源图像生成模型的发展。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}},\"contentType_en\":\"external\",\"externalUrl_en\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-image\",\"content_en\":null,\"featured\":false,\"thumbnail_zh\":null,\"thumbnail_en\":null,\"active\":true,\"order\":0,\"tag_zh\":[\"多模态\"],\"tag_en\":[\"Mutimodal AI\"],\"apiConfig_zh\":null,\"apiConfig_en\":null,\"experienceUrl_zh\":null,\"experienceUrl_en\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-11T11:36:28.005Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:50:41.638Z\"},\"externalurl_zh\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/zh/glmImage\",\"externalurl_en\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/en/glmImage\",\"title_zh\":\"GLM-Image\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-Image\",\"desc_zh\":\"智谱联合华为开源国产芯片训练的多模态 SOTA 模型\",\"desc_en\":\"Zhipu AI x Huawei: Open-sourcing the Multimodal SOTA Model Trained on Domestic Computing Power\",\"showNew\":false,\"active\":true,\"order\":4,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-22T06:27:23.206Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-19T12:47:39.192Z\"},{\"id\":5,\"link_type\":\"external\",\"article\":{\"id\":145,\"title_zh\":\"AutoGLM开源：每台手机，都可以成为AI手机\",\"title_en\":\"AutoGLM Goes Open Source\",\"createAt\":\"2025-12-08T16:00:00.000Z\",\"category\":\"blog\",\"resume_zh\":\"\",\"resume_en\":\"Unlocking the AI Phone for Everyone\",\"contentType_zh\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_zh\":null,\"content_zh\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"left\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们想做的，到底是一件什么事\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"过去的很长时间，我们一直在回答同一个问题：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"如果 AI 真的是“助手”，它能不能像人一样，自己把手机拿起来，把一件事从头做到尾？\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在我们的想象里，AI 不该只停留在聊天框里，而是可以走进用户每天真正要点的那些 App 里：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"帮你在外卖 App 里完成从选择到下单；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"帮你在云手机里，批量处理通知、点赞评论；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"帮你在销售、客服、出勤等场景里，自动做完一堆“你自己也不想点的重复动作”。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoGLM 想做的，就是这件事：让 AI 真正学会“使用手机”。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"left\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"32个月，我们具体做到了什么？\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"left\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"用一句简单的话来说：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们希望 AutoGLM，不仅能“说”，还能“做”。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"为了这一句话，我们从 2023 年 4 月——一个大多数人还不知道大模型是什么的时候，完全从零去探索每一个细节，到今天，已经 32 个月了。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1.“乱点” -\u003e “可控”\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在最开始的版本里，基于大模型所构建的系统只知道“点”、“滑”等操作，偶尔能完成一个很短的流程，更多时候会迷失在不知所谓的操作中，甚至陷入死循环。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"为了解决这类问题，我们花了近一年的时间，去梳理每一个可能的问题，尝试把这些“乱点的手”变成一只“\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"可控的手”\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"建了一整套 Phone Use 能力框架；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"把点击、滑动、输入、截图、界面理解这些最基础的动作抽象出来；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"让模型学会把一句自然语言拆解为一系列稳定、可回放的操作步骤；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"处理掉各种真实世界的“脏信息”：网络波动、弹窗打断、广告遮挡……\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2024 年 10 月 25 日，我们发布了第一个能够在真机上稳定完成一条完整操作链路的 AutoGLM，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"它被业内视为全球首个具备 Phone Use 能力的 AI Agent。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2.第一个由 AI 发出的红包\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2024 年 11 月，AutoGLM 发出了人类历史上第一个由 AI 完成的手机红包：不是脚本录制，不是内嵌 API 调用，而是通过在屏幕上“看见”界面、“理解”含义，一步一步完成点击。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"对我们来说，这是一个信号：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"从此以后，手机上的很多交互，第一次可以完全由 AI 接手。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5a9e2b63f5a24437fc435\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":965,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:21:53.814Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:21:53.813Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/640.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"640.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":21164,\"width\":850,\"height\":566,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"3.走向云手机：把能力放到一个更安全的空间\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2025 年\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，我们发布了 AutoGLM 2.0，验证了强化学习的规模扩展定律，提出了 MobileRL、ComputerRL 和 AgentRL 算法，让 AutoGLM 在上千个虚拟设备环境里同时强化学习，极大扩展了 Agent 的准确性和泛化能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"更关键的是，我们不希望 Agent 直接在用户真实手机、真实微信上肆意操作，于是选择把它放进一台和用户真实世界脱离的虚拟手机里：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"这台手机跑在云端；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"每一个动作都可以回放、审计、干预；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"真正敏感的数据可以严格隔离。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"这套设计背后的直觉很简单：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"让 AI 会用手机之前，我们要先保证，它不会在不该点的地方胡乱伸手。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"除了云手机的选择，我们主动放弃了操作微信等这些离用户隐私较近的 APP。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"left\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"为什么要开源？我们真正在意的是什么？\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"left\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"从产品的角度，AutoGLM 已经可以支撑起很多真实场景；从工程的角度，AutoGLM的积累足够写成一大摞技术报告。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"那为什么，在这个时间点，我们选择把它开源？\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们想清楚的，大概有三件事。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1.这件事只在一家公司做，是不够的\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AI 手机已经是趋势，但如果“会用手机的 AI 能力”只掌握在极少数厂商手里，那意味着：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"开发者的创新空间，要看平台愿不愿意开放接口；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"用户日常生活中最重要的那台设备，越来越像“别人家的入口”。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoGLM 开源的第一层初衷，是把这一层能力变成整个行业可以共同拥有、共同打磨的公共底座。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"你可以把它当成一块积木，放进你自己的系统里，也可以把它拆开、重写、改造，那一刻起，它就不再只是“智谱的 AutoGLM”，而是你和你的团队做出来的东西的一部分。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2.让隐私和控制权，真正留在使用方这一侧\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们也很清楚，Phone Use 能力，一旦做大，天然会碰到最敏感的那一部分世界：个人微信、支付、聊天记录、照片相册、企业内部系统。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们不希望也不应该，把这些东西握在自己手里。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"通过开源和私有化部署，企业和开发者可以在自己的合规环境中完整掌控数据、日志和权限。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"可以让手机，成为专属自己的 AI 手机。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"用一句话概括就是：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"技术向整个生态开放，数据与隐私，永远留在使用方这一侧。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"3.把我们走过的路，变成大家在Agent爆发时代的起跑线\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoGLM是一条很陡的路：我们啃过的技术难题、踩过的坑、重写过的框架，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在很多场景里都可以复用，也值得被复用。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"但这还不够，“一花独放不是春”。Agent 的爆发，需要所有人一起参与。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们更乐见的是：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"有团队基于 AutoGLM，做出真正意义上的 AI 原生手机；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"有研究者把其中的某个模块拆出来，变成一篇论文、一套新算法；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"有个人开发者把一个 Demo 改成自己的项目，在某个小众场景里真正跑起来。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们希望开源社区：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"从今天开始，人人都可以拥有自己的手机 Agent。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"left\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"你现在能拿到什么\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"left\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们开源的，是一整套可以「拿来就用」的能力，而不仅仅是一份概念说明。具体包括：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"训练好的核心模型；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Phone Use 能力框架与工具链；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"可直接跑通的 Demo，覆盖 50+ 高频中文 App；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"针对 Android 的适配层与示例工程；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"文档、快速上手指南。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"模型会以 MIT 开源许可证的形式开放，而所有代码会以 Apache-2.0 开源许可证的形式，托管在 GitHub 仓库（示例：github.com/zai-org/Open-AutoGLM）中。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"你可以把它当成一套现成的基础设施，也可以单独拆用其中的某一部分，甚至可以把它改得面目全非——只要它帮助你更接近你心目中的「AI 原生手机」。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"left\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"接下来\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"现在的 AutoGLM 不是一个完美的答案。真实世界的手机和应用，它还远远没有全部见过。未来的 AI 手机生态，也一定会有比我们今天想象得更惊喜的形态。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们做的，只是把对“AI 会不会用手机”这个问题的一次完整回答，诚实地、原原本本地，交到你们手里。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在 2025 年尾的这个时刻，正如 Andrej Karpathy 所说，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"从今天开始，人人都可以拥有自己的手机 Agent。我们面对的大概不只是“Agent 元年”，而更可能是“Agent 的十年”。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"接下来，AutoGLM 团队会继续努力，让我们一起推动 Agent 开源和研究，那个梦想中的“贾维斯”，才会真的在我们人人身边出现。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}},\"contentType_en\":\"external\",\"externalUrl_en\":\"https://autoglm.z.ai/blog/\",\"content_en\":null,\"featured\":false,\"thumbnail_zh\":null,\"thumbnail_en\":null,\"active\":true,\"order\":0,\"tag_zh\":[\"Agent\"],\"tag_en\":[\"Agentic LLM\"],\"apiConfig_zh\":null,\"apiConfig_en\":null,\"experienceUrl_zh\":null,\"experienceUrl_en\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-21T04:30:38.572Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-07T02:51:10.889Z\"},\"externalurl_zh\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/zh/research/145\",\"externalurl_en\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/en/autoglm\",\"title_zh\":\"AutoGLM\",\"title_en\":\"AutoGLM\",\"desc_zh\":\"自主规划并执行复杂多步骤任务的智能体模型\",\"desc_en\":\"An intelligent agent model that autonomously plans and executes complex, multi-step tasks\",\"showNew\":false,\"active\":true,\"order\":5,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T03:58:31.136Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-19T12:49:50.867Z\"}],\"children\":\"$L15\"}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"12:[\"$\",\"$L10\",null,{\"formats\":\"$undefined\",\"locale\":\"zh\",\"messages\":\"$4:props:messages\",\"now\":\"$undefined\",\"timeZone\":\"UTC\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L13\",null,{\"isMobile\":false,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"navConfig\":[{\"id\":2,\"link_type\":\"article\",\"article\":{\"id\":162,\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5.3：前沿编程能力与涌现的网络安全能力\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5.3: Frontier Coding with Emergent Cyber Capabilities\",\"createAt\":\"2026-08-14T06:00:00.000Z\",\"category\":\"blog\",\"resume_zh\":null,\"resume_en\":null,\"contentType_zh\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_zh\":null,\"content_zh\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"今天我们发布GLM-5.3，与GLM-5.2相比，基座模型没变，但通过极致的后训练Scaling大大提高了模型的智能上界：数十倍的长程任务环境、更丰富多样的环境类型、超长的后训练时间。我们发现充分的模型后训练涌现出超出预期的模型能力。相比前代，GLM-5.3的新能力包括：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"更强的编程能力\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。GLM-5.3是编程能力最强的开源模型，在内部自建体感评测中较GLM-5.2\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"提升50%\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，在包括Terminal Bench 3.0、Agents' Last Exam (CLI)在内的公开基准测试中取得开源第一。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"网络安全能力\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。在白盒代码审查与漏洞发现等安全任务中，GLM-5.3的表现持平Mythos 5，展现出面向网络安全防御场景的强大潜力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":3,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"后训练Scaling\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。上述全部提升都来自后训练。基于IndexShare、SAO、以及持续演进的新一代Slime框架，我们在与GLM-5.2完全相同基座上高效推进强化学习，可能我们还远未开发出这个基座的智能上界。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":4,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"开源\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。我们将在发布两周后开放模型权重，此前完成安全评估与模型加固。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"即日起上线智谱官方编程工具ZCode、效率工具AutoClaw，上线GLM Coding Plan全量用户及开放订阅。TraeWork/TraeCode/扣子、WorkBuddy/CodeBuddy、Qoder/QwenWork、CatPaw、JoyCode、OpenCode等编码平台开放抢先体验。API很快上线，完整模型权重将在两周内开源，此前需完成必要的安全加固，尽可能限制其潜在攻击能力，保留其防御价值。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"今天13:00，GLM Coding Plan全员额度重置，所有用户后台「用量统计」可见使用额度回满。技术Blog：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"6a826923e14fd9adcae72f39\",\"type\":\"link\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5.3https://\",\"newTab\":true,\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":3,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5.3\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"强大的编程\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在多项主流基准测试中GLM-5.3是当前排名最高的开源模型，编程与智能体能力接近Claude Fable 5，编程体感超过其他国产模型。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在衡量模型于真实终端环境中完成复杂任务的Terminal-Bench 3.0上，GLM-5.3得分从4.6提升至\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"28.3\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"；在聚焦长程软件工程与持续代码修改能力的DeepSWE v1.1上，得分从46.2提升至\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"66.9\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"；在覆盖多类真实专业场景、强调跨工具协作与长程任务的Agents' Last Exam上，得分从23.8提升至\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"28.5\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。在覆盖44种职业、考察真实高价值知识工作的GDPval-AA v2中得分\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1769\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，展现基于编程能力涌现的专业任务执行能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"整体来看，GLM-5.3在复杂软件工程、终端操作和更广泛的真实世界 Agent任务上均取得非常显著的进步。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"6a8268cae14fd9adcae72f35\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":1059,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:05.308Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:05.307Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/1-1.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"1-1.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":1219456,\"width\":4239,\"height\":2504,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"自研的Z.ai Code Bench评估模型在真实编程场景中的综合体感。模型会被置于复杂的本地开发环境，并在不同思考档位下执行端到端任务，更接近开发者实际使用Coding Agent时的体验。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"测试结果显示，GLM-5.3在效果和Token利用率之间取得了更好的平衡。在High档位下，GLM-5.3达到31.4%的准确率，超过Claude Opus 4.8最高档位的29.5%，每项任务平均输出约5万tokens，而Opus 4.8需要约12万tokens，意味着\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5.3可以用更短的执行路径完成任务。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"id\":\"6a8268e2e14fd9adcae72f36\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":1060,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:28.850Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:28.850Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/2-2.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"2-2.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":224248,\"width\":3295,\"height\":2345,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5.3训练过程中，我们不只让模型完成编程题，而是把训练环境扩展到更接近真实专家工作的完整流程，有些任务的工作量相当于一位工程师连续数天的工作。以机器学习优化任务为例，模型使用与算法工程师相同的计算集群、存储系统、内部文档、代码库和实验结果，端到端实现可量化的提速。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在这样的环境中训练，模型学到的不只是单向执行指令，而是从发现问题开始，推进分析、实施验证，最终独立完成工作。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"涌现的网络安全能力\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在任务环境不断扩张的过程中，我们观察到模型在网络安全领域的表现超出预期。安全能力的出现并不偶然，安全工作本质上是约束严格的编程能力。我们从2025年9月开始在这个方向投入研究，在GLM-5.2与GLM-5.3的研发过程中，与国内多家头部安全实验室一同推进更多长程任务环境，构建更专业化的评测与执行框架（harness）。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"从任务链条看，网络安全能力大致包括代码审查、漏洞验证、漏洞利用以及真实环境中的攻防闭环。我们选取了覆盖漏洞分析、验证和利用不同阶段的三个基准，对GLM-5.3的网络安全能力进行了全面评估，GLM-5.3当前优势主要集中在前半段。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在CyberGym测试中，模型从白盒源代码出发，通过触发程序故障来识别和验证漏洞。GLM-5.3得分为84.5%，高于GLM-5.2的77.2%，也略高于Mythos 5的83.8%和GPT-5.6 Sol的83.6%。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在更考验深度推理能力的ExploitBench中，模型需要进一步理解真实漏洞的成因，并完成相应的利用。GLM-5.3得分为54.4%，是GLM-5.2（24.4%）的两倍多，但仍低于Mythos 5的78.0%和GPT-5.6 Sol的76.5%。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"ExploitGym考察模型在限定时间内能够完成多少漏洞利用任务，按吞吐量对预算进行归一化后，GLM-5.3在两小时内完成105项任务，六小时内完成130项，相对于GLM-5.2分别完成29项和39项提升巨大。Mythos 5仍然领先，两个时间段分别完成181项和247项。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"6a826a84e14fd9adcae72f43\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":1061,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:47.186Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:50:47.185Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/3-2.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"3-2.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":569345,\"width\":4239,\"height\":1548,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"三个基准呈现出相同的趋势：越接近漏洞利用链的前端，GLM-5.3相较GLM-5.2的提升越明显；越深入完整利用，模型与Mythos 5等闭源前沿模型之间的差距也越大。换句话说，GLM-5.3进步最快的方向，正是当前仍需要重点追赶的方向。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1.安全评估成果\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"从GLM-5.2发布以来，我们联合国内清华大学、南开大学，以及云起无垠、绿盟科技、赛博昆仑、DARKNAVY、华顺信安、奇安信、安恒信息、元序星核、腾讯玄武、云鼎实验室等多家安全团队，开展了密集的红队测试与安全评估。累计发现漏洞2,436个（经过初筛、去重），其中1,097个为中高危，许多漏洞多年来甚至几十年都未被发现，最早可追溯至约45年前。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"代表性漏洞覆盖系统内核、操作系统、浏览器引擎、开源基础组件、互联网应用与互联网协议等269个项目，部分漏洞的威胁甚至可以让Android、Windows、macOS以及某国民级通信软件出现大范围崩溃。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"这些发现已发展成为一项持续的漏洞发现和披露工作。相关漏洞已陆续提交CNNVD/CNVD等国家漏洞库。为提高披露过程的透明度，我们建立了Z.ai安全披露账本https://cvd.z.ai/，记录漏洞从发现、确认到修复的进展。账本将持续更新，为了确保负责任的安全披露，我们仅公开已经经过披露和厂商修复的漏洞，对于那些仍处于协调披露阶段的漏洞，我们会展示漏洞的哈希值以供后续核验。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"6a826914e14fd9adcae72f38\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":1062,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:51:18.444Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:51:18.444Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/image%20(4).png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"image (4).png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":3758274,\"width\":9008,\"height\":5692,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"参考Zerodium、Crowdfense、Apple Security Bounty、Pwn2Own等全球漏洞交易与赏金市场公开报价，这些漏洞创造的经济价值达3000万元。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2.抱抱脸的故事——网络安全能力必须更加开放\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Hugging Face官方披露事件给出的警示：如果强大的攻击能力正在扩散，防守能力就不能只在少数闭源模型公司。闭源模式将前沿安全能力异化为少数机构的特权，Anthropic向约150家大型机构提供Mythos模型及安全服务，更广泛的企业和开源项目则难以获得同等水平的安全能力支持，甚至会在遭遇攻击、最需要帮助的时候，被闭源模型拒之门外。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"没有开源反而是这个时代最不安全的事情。随着GLM-5.3的发布与开源，我们将同步启动“开源的盾”计划：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1.对重点开源项目开展持续安全审计，帮助维护者免费发现和修复风险（\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"6a8269b6e14fd9adcae72f3a\",\"type\":\"link\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"https%25252525253A%25252525252F%25252525252Fhttps%25252525253A%25252525252F%25252525252Fhuggingface.co%25252525252Fspaces%25252525252Fzai-org%25252525252FOpenVuln\",\"newTab\":true,\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":3,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/zai-org/OpenVuln\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"）\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2.向开源社区免费提供模型额度及更加便捷的防御入口，开源项目维护者可以申请用于安全审计和防御任务\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"3.在ZCode中提供代码审计功能，让安全检查进入日常研发流程\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"当最强的矛被锁在少数人手里，最好的盾必须属于所有人。我们会持续优化GLM安全能力并坚持开源，与全球开发者、安全研究人员共同建设一套持续生长的防御体系，让前沿模型从少数机构的特权，转化为服务开源社区的安全公共品。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"3.一个小插曲：追凶neo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2026年7月，一台位于巴西的临时文件服务器进入Ferret的监测范围。Ferret是GLM-5.3首批合作伙伴FOFA的追踪分析引擎。GLM-5.3很快发现，这并不是一台普通服务器，目录中出现了大量攻击基础设施信息。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"继续分析后，一个名为“Neo”的AI Agent浮出水面，其目标是攻击A国的会计师事务所、税务服务公司和记账机构。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Neo获得了很高的系统权限。不到两个月，它管理着4台服务器、7个域名、6万个邮箱和100多个脚本，发出18567封钓鱼邮件。面对数千个开放目录、数万份日志和高度碎片化的攻击线索，仅靠人工几乎不可能发现其中的关联。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5.3迅速提取关键线索，关联攻击，并辅助安全研究人员还原出整条攻击链：攻击者如何搜集A国会计行业目标，搭建邮件系统，直至伪装成企业客户和行业机构，准备后续恶意文件，最终有效帮助Ferret捕获该攻击。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"这与此前Hugging Face安全事件形成了呼应。在Hugging Face事件中，前沿模型逃逸发起攻击，GLM-5.2被部署到本地帮助完成取证；在这次事件中，Agent为攻击方工作，GLM-5.3又帮助防守方从证据中还原攻击链。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"同样是模型，站在哪一边，取决于掌握它的人与目的。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"4.最好的安全，是事故最终没有发生\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"潜在风险离我们并不遥远。从一条消息、一封邮件，到互联网的底层协议、机器人，数字世界的安全边界早已连接着个人设备、企业网络、互联网基础设施甚至是真实世界，影响着我们每一个人。GLM-5.3作为“开源之盾”的意义，就是要帮助更多安全团队抢在攻击者之前发现风险，让风险在影响用户之前化解和修复。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"保护Cursor，守住开发者的工作台\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Cursor是全球数百万开发者日常使用的AI代码编辑器。在一次模型能力评估中，清华大学NASP实验室借助GLM-5.3，对Cursor的二进制代码、跨语言架构和权限边界展开分析，发现其Rust与Electron混合架构及权限校验逻辑中存在潜在失陷风险。攻击者可能借此实现任意文件写入，进一步窃取敏感信息，甚至接管开发环境。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"这一风险隐藏在复杂的程序逻辑中，无法通过孤立检查单个代码缺陷发现。挖掘过程中，GLM-5.3深度参与逆向分析全流程，协助安全研究人员还原程序逻辑、定位异常路径，并从大量候选路径中排除干扰，最终在授权测试环境中完成风险验证。目前，安全研究团队也已联系Cursor方面推进修复，漏洞已上报CNVD和CNNVD。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"保护国民级通讯APP，守住数亿人的设备安全\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"安全研究人员在一款拥有数亿日活用户的国民级即时通信软件中发现异常。攻击者无需诱导用户点击链接或打开文件，只需发送一条看似正常的消息，就可能在用户几乎无感知的情况下触发漏洞，进而让用户失去设备控制权。整个过程可以远程完成，且具有较强的稳定性和隐蔽性。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"该漏洞深藏于自研私有协议、内容处理逻辑与内存管理机制之中，触发条件涉及复杂状态机和极难复现的时序问题。由于缺少公开资料，安全研究人员借助GLM-5.3，从海量二进制代码中定位异常、还原逻辑，并逐步完成路径验证。最终，这场可能波及数亿用户的安全事件没有发生，风险在抵达用户之前就被发现并拦了下来。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"保护DNS基础设施，守住互联网的“导航系统”\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"DNS如同数字世界的“北斗导航系统”，一旦大面积瘫痪，全球的网站、邮件和云服务都可能因无法找到正确地址而无法运行。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"清华大学NISL实验室与云起无垠安全研究团队借助GLM模型，在诞生于1983年的DNS协议中，发现了一类潜伏40余年的关键协议级漏洞。与常见的软件漏洞不同，这次发现的是互联网底层协议规则本身存在的问题。攻击者只需发送少量特殊请求，就能将服务器的计算压力最高放大近8万倍，进而导致网站无法访问、邮件中断和云服务失效。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"根据网络测绘估算，该漏洞可能影响全球九成以上的主流DNS系统，涉及超过1000万处公网DNS服务。GLM协助安全研究人员提前发现这一底层风险，为DNS系统的修复与加固提供依据。也意味着GLM的安全能力也由软件代码审查进一步延伸至互联网基础协议，开始参与保护整个数字世界赖以运行的基础设施。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"保护邮件与办公系统，化解微软全球级安全事件\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"一次邮件预览，险些成为进入企业网络的入口。赛博昆仑借助GLM模型发现三枚微软重大漏洞，涉及全球用户每天使用的邮件与办公系统，覆盖客户端邮件预览、文档处理和服务端远程访问等多个环节。这些漏洞串联成“客户端预览即中招、服务端可被远程攻破”的攻击路径，相当于攻击者可能通过一封邮件进入用户终端，再以终端为跳板渗透企业网络，使相关产品的大量用户和部署环境面临风险。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"历史上同类漏洞曾在全球范围造成严重损失，例如在2021年的ProxyLogon事件中，大量的Exchange服务器沦陷。目前，安全研究团队已经将三大漏洞提交微软并完成修复，微软官方致谢了“Kunlun Lab\u0026GLM”，意味着一场可能波及全球用户和企业的安全事件被提前化解。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"保护真实世界，提前阻断人形机器人失控风险\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"DARKNAVY·深蓝研发的安全AI系统deepsec借助GLM模型，在一家全球顶级具身智能机器人厂商的系统中发现致命级漏洞，攻击者一旦利用该漏洞，可能同时远程劫持上千台机器人，并控制其执行恶意动作。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"面对由多套独立安全系统组成的复杂架构，deepsec将顶尖安全研究员的经验工作流与GLM模型的长程网络安全任务执行能力结合起来，从机器人的公开文档出发，完成信息收集、静态分析、漏洞挖掘和风险验证，逐步还原系统逻辑、梳理安全边界，最终定位并确认了这一关键风险。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"随着漏洞得到修复，一场可能影响真实世界的“机器人集体失控”事故被提前阻断。GLM保护的不再只是代码、终端和网络，也开始延伸到与真实世界直接互动的智能设备。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"上述漏洞均已联系厂商进行修复，已进入国家CNNVD/CNVD国家漏洞库负责任披露与协同修复流程。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"6a826ac6e14fd9adcae72f46\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":1063,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:58:32.546Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:58:32.546Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%E7%89%88.mp4\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"中文版.mp4\",\"mimeType\":\"video/mp4\",\"filesize\":58440600,\"width\":null,\"height\":null,\"focalX\":null,\"focalY\":null},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"有责任的开源\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"随着模型能力提升，我们同步强化安全体系，以便先进智能能够继续广泛发挥作用，同时对最高风险用途施加更严格的审查。针对GLM-5.3，我们构建了迄今为止最稳健的风险审查系统。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5.3的风险审查系统采用了分层设计，横跨外围API到模型内部，以提高准确性与冗余度，这遵循了安全防护体系中纵深防御的基本原则，即从不假设某一层防护是完美的，而让多层相互独立的防线彼此冗余，共同组成鲁棒的防护系统。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"外层分类器（classifier flag）：用轻量模型标记并拦截大规模滥用请求；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"推理监控器（reasoning monitor）：在模型推理过程中实时审查任务意图，判断是否存在潜在危害；\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":3,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"深度安全对齐：让模型从根本上自主识别并拒绝攻击性请求，这也是开源权重场景下唯一仍然有效的防线。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在设计分层审查系统时，我们还遵循了另一安全防护体系的基本原则，即风险分级。审查系统的任务是抑制高安全风险的攻击性滥用，但不牺牲实验性质、防御性质和教学性质的使用。为了达成这个目标，我们首先要让分类器、监控器和模型本身学会以意图为中心而非关键词为中心的审查方法，因为网络安全场景中攻击与防御任务在字面上高度相似，真正区分二者的是意图与语境。我们进行了针对性的差分数据合成，并对大量越狱变体和伪装方法构造了对抗性数据，确保审查系统能够高度智能地工作。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"更进一步，我们对网络安全领域的常见任务进行了分类，比如安全知识问答、蓝队防御、CTF题目、漏洞挖掘与修复、漏洞利用与攻击、渗透测试、真实入侵等，并分别对每一类别任务构造了大量阶梯型风险的实例数据，让风险审查系统能够精准拦截高风险任务请求，又不“误杀”其余合法合规、风险等级低的常规任务。模型最敏感的能力仅通过“网络安全受信访问”计划保留给经过验证的用户使用。值得一提的是，安全对齐是一个持续对抗的过程，对抗数据、风险分级实例数据的合成都不是一次性的。我们会不断进行红队自动化攻击越狱测试，并使用新产生的越狱样本不断加固审查系统。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在全面推出前，我们进行了尤为密集的安全性评估与广泛的红队测试。评估表明，系统建立了高标准的安全防护线，能够有效拦截明确的恶意攻击与高危漏洞利用滥用，同时未因安全策略过度收紧而牺牲能力，能够执行漏洞检测和修补、CTF教学等正向安全任务。在正式开源前，我们也邀请国内顶级安全团队对模型的风险任务能力进行专业评估，DARKNAVY团队评估认为，该模型在风险防护与能力释放之间取得了良好平衡，相比于前代模型显著提高了未授权恶意滥用的门槛。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"人工智能发展不应该是某个国家的独奏，而应当是全球合作的交响。随着GLM-5.3的发布及开源，安全防御能力将不再是少数机构的特权，而是全球开发者都能平等获得和共同完善的公共能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"感谢与GLM-5.3并肩作战的国内安全团队。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}},\"contentType_en\":\"external\",\"externalUrl_en\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5.3\",\"content_en\":null,\"featured\":false,\"thumbnail_zh\":null,\"thumbnail_en\":null,\"active\":true,\"order\":0,\"tag_zh\":[\"基座模型\"],\"tag_en\":[\"Base Model\"],\"apiConfig_zh\":null,\"apiConfig_en\":null,\"experienceUrl_zh\":null,\"experienceUrl_en\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:58:46.875Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T01:55:24.462Z\"},\"externalurl_zh\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5\",\"externalurl_en\":\"https://z.ai/blog/glm-5\",\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5.3\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5.3\",\"desc_zh\":\"前沿编程能力与涌现的网络安全能力\",\"desc_en\":\"Frontier Coding with Emergent Cyber Capabilities\",\"showNew\":true,\"active\":true,\"order\":1,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-10T01:33:00.153Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-19T12:46:38.424Z\"},{\"id\":4,\"link_type\":\"external\",\"article\":{\"id\":156,\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo发布：多模态Coding基座模型\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo: A Multimodal Coding Foundation Model\",\"createAt\":\"2026-04-01T16:00:00.000Z\",\"category\":\"blog\",\"resume_zh\":null,\"resume_en\":\"A multimodal coding foundation model for visual programming\",\"contentType_zh\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_zh\":null,\"content_zh\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Agent时代，模型能力由模型智能以及其处理的context容量两个维度定义。一个能够原生处理图片、视频、文本等多模态context，同时擅长复杂编程、长程规划、动作执行的Coding基座模型，将是所有AI原生应用的基石。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"今天，我们发布\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，面向视觉编程打造的多模态Coding基座模型。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo从预训练阶段深度融合视觉与文本能力，让编程不再局限于纯文本输入。模型能看懂设计稿、截图、网页界面，并据此生成完整可运行的代码，真正做到看得懂画面、写得出代码。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf9751f21c2c2005c82ca7\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":955,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:32:49.527Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:32:49.526Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/%E6%99%BA%E8%B0%B1-%E4%B8%BBCase-%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87-0402%20(1).m4v\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"智谱-主Case-中文-0402 (1).m4v\",\"mimeType\":\"video/mp4\",\"filesize\":159012884,\"width\":null,\"height\":null,\"focalX\":null,\"focalY\":null},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"核心要点如下：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"原生多模态Coding基座：原生理解图片、视频、设计稿、文档版面等多模态输入，并支持画框、截图、读网页等多模态工具调用，上下文窗口扩展至200k，将Agent的感知-行动链路从纯文本延伸到视觉交互。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"兼顾视觉与编程能力：在多模态Coding、Tool Use、GUI Agent等核心基准上取得领先表现。通过多任务协同RL等技术手段，确保纯文本场景下的编程、推理、工具调用等能力不退化。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"深度适配Claude Code与龙虾场景：与Claude Code、OpenClaw/AutoClaw等Agent深度协同，支持“看懂环境→规划动作→执行任务”的完整闭环，并提供全套官方Skills，开箱即用。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"多模态Coding基座\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在多模态Coding、Agentic任务以及纯文本Coding维度的评测基准上，GLM-5V-Turbo均以更小尺寸取得了领先表现。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf9774f21c2c2005c82ca8\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":956,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:33:24.383Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:33:24.382Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/download_image.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"download_image.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":165654,\"width\":1080,\"height\":747,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo在设计稿还原、视觉代码生成、多模态检索与问答、视觉探查等基准上均取得领先表现；在衡量真实GUI环境操控能力的AndroidWorld、WebVoyager等基准上同样表现突出。在纯文本Coding能力方面，GLM-5V-Turbo在CC-Bench-V2的Backend、Frontend和Repo Exploration三项核心基准测试中均保持稳定表现，表明\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"视觉能力引入后，纯文本编程与推理能力保持了同等水准\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf9787f21c2c2005c82ca9\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":957,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:33:43.131Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:33:43.130Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/download_image%20(1).png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"download_image (1).png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":100903,\"width\":1080,\"height\":381,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在AutoClaw等龙虾Agent中接入GLM-5V-Turbo后，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾具备了真正的视觉能力，能看懂屏幕上的信息\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。模型在衡量龙虾Agent任务执行质量的PinchBench、ClawEval和ZClawBench上取得优异成绩，验证了其在复杂任务执行场景中的综合能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"内测阶段，字节跳动、美团、快手等互联网大厂\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"合作伙伴对GLM-5V-Turbo给予了高度评价\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“GLM-5V-Turbo实现了从设计稿到代码的完整还原，作为一款视觉理解模型，能够很好地满足开发者的前端开发场景。”——TRAE模型测评团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“原生多模态能力的引入并未削弱其编程逻辑，其编程能力仍属于国内第一梯队。增强了AI at Work领域下D2C、图片处理等方向的工作体验。”——美团某团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“它为Agent安上了「眼睛」，同时在编程领域展现出优于同类多模态模型的能力，在视觉编程场景中更具竞争力。”——快手万擎模型测评团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo能够取得性能领先在于其\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"模型架构、训练方法、数据构造、工具链四个层面的系统性升级\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"原生多模态融合：GLM-5V-Turbo从预训练阶段开始进行文本与视觉能力深度融合，并在后训练阶段实现多模态协同优化。我们研发了新一代CogViT视觉编码器，在通用物体识别、细粒度理解、几何与空间感知上均达最优，也设计了兼容多模态输入且推理友好的MTP结构，在多模态场景下实现了较高的推理效率。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"30+ 任务协同强化学习：在强化学习阶段同时优化30+任务类型，覆盖STEM、grounding、video、GUI Agent等子领域，模型在感知、推理、Agentic执行和人类体感上均获稳健提升，协同强化学习有效缓解了单领域训练的不稳定性。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Agentic数据与任务构造：针对Agent数据稀缺和验证困难的行业挑战，我们构建从元素感知到序列级动作预测的多层级体系，基于合成环境大规模生成可控、可验证的训练数据，并从预训练阶段即注入Agentic元能力（如将GUI Agent PRM数据加入预训练以降低幻觉），同时探索非对称优化，用多模态评估任务撬动更强的Agent能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"多模态工具链扩展：在文本工具基础上，GLM-5V-Turbo新增支持多模态搜索、画框、截图、读网页等多模态tools，将编程与任务执行的感知-行动链路从纯文本扩展到视觉交互。与Claude Code、AutoClaw等龙虾的协同效果进一步增强，支持“看懂环境→规划动作→执行任务”的完整闭环。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"典型场景展示\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1.图像即代码\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo尤其擅长核心视觉编程场景。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf97b8f21c2c2005c82caa\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":958,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:34:32.555Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:34:32.554Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/%E6%99%BA%E8%B0%B1-%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96Case1-%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87-0402%20(1).m4v\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"智谱-额外Case1-中文-0402 (1).m4v\",\"mimeType\":\"video/mp4\",\"filesize\":40523666,\"width\":null,\"height\":null,\"focalX\":null,\"focalY\":null},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"前端复刻\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：发送草图、设计稿、参考网站的截图或录屏，模型就能直接理解布局、配色、组件层级与交互逻辑，生成完整可运行的前端工程，准确还原版式、配色、动效等视觉细节。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GUI自主探索复刻\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：结合Claude Code等框架，GLM-5V-Turbo能凭借自身强大的GUI Agent能力自主探索目标网站，浏览页面结构、梳理各页面之间的跳转关系、采集视觉素材与交互细节，最后基于记录的探索结果直接生成代码复现整个站点，实现从“看图复刻”到“GUI探索复刻”的能力跃升。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"交互式编辑\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：支持按需求增删页面模块、修改文案与样式、调整布局结构，并可补充按钮反馈、弹窗切换、表单联动等交互功能，实现可视化迭代编辑。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2.为龙虾安上眼睛\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾的任务边界被大幅拓宽\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，例如可以浏览网页和文档，生成图文并茂的报告、PPT，还可以查询并解读K线图等复杂图表。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoClaw已上线“股票分析师”Skill，利用GLM-5V-Turbo的原生视觉能力，龙虾能直接看懂K线走势、估值区间图和券商研报图表，实现四路数据源60秒并行采集，输出\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"图文交错\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"的研报。立即在AutoClaw中\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"切换至GLM-5V-Turbo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，试试提问“帮我分析今天XXX的股价，生成专业分析报告”。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"除视觉编程与龙虾任务外，GLM-5V-Turbo在多模态搜索、深度研究、GUI Agent、感知Grounding等更广泛的Agentic场景中也实现了显著的性能提升。为此，我们提供了一组\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"官方Skills\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，涵盖图像Captioning、视觉Grounding、基于文档的写作、简历筛选、提示词生成等原生能力，以及基于GLM-OCR和GLM-Image构建的文字识别、表格识别、手写体识别、公式识别和文生图能力，帮助用户在更多场景中释放模型的多模态潜力。上述Skills已上线ClawHub，一键安装即可体验全部能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"ClawHub链接\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"69d8a70049068ea474ee78c4\",\"type\":\"link\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"https://clawhub.ai/zai-org/glm-master-skill\",\"newTab\":true,\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":3,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"https://clawhub.ai/zai-org/glm-master-skill\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GitHub链接：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"69d8a75849068ea474ee78c5\",\"type\":\"link\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"https://github.com/zai-org/GLM-skills\",\"newTab\":true,\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":3,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"https://github.com/zai-org/GLM-skills\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"立即体验\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"欢迎广大用户通过以下方式接入GLM-5V-Turbo：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"1.产品体验\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoClaw（澳龙）：https://autoglm.zhipuai.cn/autoclaw/\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Z.ai：https://chat.z.ai\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h3\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"2.官方API接入\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"BigModel\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\" 开放平台\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/models/vlm/glm-5v-turbo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Z.ai：https://docs.z.ai/guides/vlm/glm-5v-turbo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Coding Plan：现面向Coding Plan用户开放申请；后续GLM Coding Plan也会纳入GLM-5V-Turbo，敬请期待。申请问卷：https://zhipu-ai.feishu.cn/share/base/form/shrcndgpmRlJoD5rMmIavUrPwzg\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf9827f21c2c2005c82cab\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":959,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:36:23.345Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:36:23.344Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/da5d94bc5f15e2975fc6f4b5468036c8.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"da5d94bc5f15e2975fc6f4b5468036c8.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":588642,\"width\":1170,\"height\":1449,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}},\"contentType_en\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_en\":null,\"content_en\":null,\"featured\":false,\"thumbnail_zh\":null,\"thumbnail_en\":null,\"active\":true,\"order\":0,\"tag_zh\":[\"基座模型\"],\"tag_en\":[\"Mutimodal AI\"],\"apiConfig_zh\":null,\"apiConfig_en\":null,\"experienceUrl_zh\":null,\"experienceUrl_en\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-21T04:52:36.490Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:36:51.645Z\"},\"externalurl_zh\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/zh/research/156\",\"externalurl_en\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/en/research/156\",\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5V-Turbo\",\"desc_zh\":\"面向视觉编程打造的多模态Coding基座模型\",\"desc_en\":\"Multimodal Coding Model\",\"showNew\":false,\"active\":true,\"order\":2,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-22T06:37:12.154Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-19T12:48:26.455Z\"},{\"id\":1,\"link_type\":\"external\",\"article\":{\"id\":155,\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5-Turbo：龙虾增强的基座模型\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5-Turbo: A Foundation Model Enhanced for OpenClaw\",\"createAt\":\"2026-03-15T16:00:00.000Z\",\"category\":\"blog\",\"resume_zh\":null,\"resume_en\":\"A foundation model for OpenClaw\",\"contentType_zh\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_zh\":null,\"content_zh\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们推出GLM-5-Turbo——一个面向OpenClaw龙虾场景深度优化的基座模型。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"体验过OpenClaw的用户都有一个共同感受：模型能聊好天，但未必能干好活。问题的根源不在框架，而在底层模型本身。通用大模型在进入真实复杂的Agent场景后，容易在长链路任务中失速。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Harness再多，不如模型自身变强。GLM-5-Turbo从训练阶段就针对龙虾任务的核心需求进行专项优化，增强如工具调用、指令遵循、定时与持续性任务、长链路执行等核心能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在自研基准测试ZClawBench中取得国产模型第一的成绩\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"；多家互联网大厂在龙虾场景内测中给予高度评价。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们推出\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Claw龙虾套餐\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，及面向企业级场景的Claw安全管理体系。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾原生模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾任务不是简单的一问一答，通常涉及多轮理解、任务拆解、工具调用、状态衔接、时间触发和持续执行的长链路工作流。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"通用模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"即使在对话能力上表现优秀，一旦进入真实龙虾场景，仍然容易出现指令遵循偏差、工具调用不稳定、长任务中途失速等问题。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"要从根本上解决这些难题，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"必须在基座模型层进行深度优化\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"——这正是GLM-5-Turbo的出发点。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"从训练数据构造到优化目标设计，我们构造真实Agent工作流使模型在龙虾任务中具备可执行性。重点增强以下核心能力：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Tool Calling——调用不掉链子。强化对外部工具与各类Skills的调用能力。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Instruction Following——复杂指令拆解更强。对复杂多层、长链路指令理解和拆解更准确，支持识别目标、规划步骤、多智能体协同。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"定时与持续性任务——更懂时间维度，长任务不中断。针对定时触发、长时间运行等场景进行重点优化，能够更好理解时间维度上的要求。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"高吞吐长链路——执行更稳。针对数据吞吐量大、链条长的任务进一步提升执行效率与稳定性，适合长程业务流程。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"type\":\"linebreak\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾场景基准ZClawBench\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"随着龙虾OpenClaw的普及，如何评测模型在龙虾场景的能力成为全行业焦点。基于对OpenClaw大量真实用例的分析，我们发布龙虾场景端到端Agent评测基准ZClawBench。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"当前OpenClaw的任务类型覆盖安装配置、代码开发、信息搜集、数据分析、内容创作等多元化任务，用户群体也从早期的开发者扩展到效率办公人群、金融从业者、运维工程师、内容创作者与研究分析人员等。同时，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Skills的使用比例在短时间内从26%快速增长至45%\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，表明Agent能力正向模块化与技能化的生态方向演进。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"基于该基准的评测结果显示，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5-Turbo在OpenClaw场景中的表现相比GLM-5提升显著，在多项关键任务上整体领先于多家主流模型。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf95dff21c2c2005c82c9d\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":951,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:26:39.011Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:26:39.009Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/111.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"111.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":1194870,\"width\":3255,\"height\":2270,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"ZClawBench的题库与测试轨迹已全面公开，欢迎业界共同验证与完善。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"用户真实体验是试金石。GLM-5-Turbo以Pony-Alpha-2为代号接入AutoClaw澳龙，在用户盲测中，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"90%\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"的受访者认为GLM-5-Turbo的表现优于其他国产模型。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"内测阶段，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾生态的互联网大厂对GLM-5-Turbo给予高度评价\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“精准的工具调用配合长程任务的稳定可靠，完美驱动了桌面级Agent上的跨应用数据流转与系统API操控。在攻克办公场景的‘幻觉’痛点上表现优秀！”——阿里QoderWork模型测评团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“指令遵循力压群雄，面对长任务更精准不掉链子，极大提升了多智能体构建的成功率。”——扣子Coze测评团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“定时与长链路任务稳健，对比同类模型展现出明显第一梯队的优势，非常靠谱。”——美团某团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“高吞吐执行极快且不失速，响应稳定性领跑同类模型，真正解决了Agent的执行难题。”——快手万擎测评团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在编程场景，GLM-5-Turbo延续GLM模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Agentic Engineering\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"的表现：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"quote\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"“编程能力稳居第一梯队，在Coding Agent实测中优于同类模型，处理长链路代码任务非常稳健。”——字节TRAE团队\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5-Turbo已接入软通动力旗下机械革命盒子中，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"面向全球首发接入GLM模型的机械革命“龙虾盒子”\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，打造原生AI Agent终端体验。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf95f3f21c2c2005c82c9e\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":952,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:26:59.699Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:26:59.698Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/222.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"222.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":1412232,\"width\":1932,\"height\":810,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾套餐喂饱你的AI同事\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"龙虾太能干活，自然也吃tokens。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"一个典型的龙虾任务，比如完成一次跨部门的会议纪要整理与任务分发，可能涉及数十轮工具调用与上下文衔接，tokens消耗远超普通对话。对于使用龙虾的企业和个人来说，tokens成为最大的成本瓶颈。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"为了让企业和个人实现龙虾“tokens自由”，智谱即日起推出基于GLM-5-Turbo的龙虾套餐，包含个人版和Team版。无论你是一人公司、创业团队，或者是大中型企业，都能根据自身业务规模灵活订阅套餐。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf9609f21c2c2005c82c9f\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":953,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:27:21.208Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:27:21.208Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/333-2.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"333-2.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":312315,\"width\":1280,\"height\":604,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"每个账号最多购买5个。企业可通过龙虾套餐Team版，按照实际员工数灵活订阅，以可控成本实现tokens的充分保障以及AI员工的稳定在线。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"此外，我们在龙虾套餐的基础上，专门构建了\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"一套面向企业级场景的OpenClaw安全管理体系“Claw for Enterprise Security”\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。支持对不同类型Claw的统一调度与权限编排——无论是信息搜集、数据分析、代码开发还是跨系统操作，企业可以根据业务流程灵活组合Claw能力，并通过集中化的管控台对每一个Agent任务的执行路径、工具调用链路和资源消耗进行实时可视化监控，让复杂的多Agent协同不再是黑盒。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在安全保障层面，该系统提供多层防护机制\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"：基于角色的权限管理确保每个Claw只能在授权范围内调用工具和访问数据；所有操作均生成完整的审计日志，满足企业合规要求；敏感业务数据全程加密处理，严格遵守数据本地化要求，不离开企业可控边界；关键业务节点保留人工审批机制，防止自动化流程产生不可控的业务风险。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"正在到来的变革是，以OpenClaw为代表的Agent正在进入组织内部，让每一家企业都拥有7×24小时在线、随叫随到的AI员工；同时，它们也成为我们每个人的专属AI助理，把人从流程化、重复性的琐事中真正解放出来。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们正在见证大模型从提效工具，走向企业劳动力的一场关键跃迁。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h1\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"接入与使用\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5-Turbo现已上线，开发者和企业用户可以通过智谱开放平台\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"BigModel.cn\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"直接调用API，或者通过龙虾套餐接入。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM Coding Plan Max现已支持GLM-5-Turbo，Pro套餐将在本月尽快支持，Lite套餐将在4月支持接入。Coding Plan也可用于OpenClaw接入体验；如需长期稳定运行、后台持续执行或更高负载的Agent场景，建议优先使用龙虾套餐。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5、GLM-5-Turbo作为对标Claude Opus的高阶模型，将按照“高峰期3倍，非高峰期2倍”系数消耗额度。作为限时福利，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-5-Turbo将在非高峰期仅作1倍抵扣持续到4月底。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoClaw澳龙默认模型为GLM-5-Turbo，让所有非程序员群体可以体验GLM-5-Turbo龙虾能力，享受一定免费额度。即日起至3月22日为澳龙限时福利，加油包最高享3.4折优惠（加油包自购买起7日内有效）。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69cf964af21c2c2005c82ca0\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":954,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:28:26.424Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:28:26.423Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/444.png\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"444.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"filesize\":63251,\"width\":1706,\"height\":540,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"官方 API 接入\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"智谱开放平台：BigModel.cn\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Z.ai：api.z.ai\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM Coding Plan\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Coding Plan Max已纳入GLM-5-Turbo\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Pro版将在本月尽快支持\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在线体验\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"AutoClaw澳龙客户端：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"https://autoglm.zhipuai.cn/autoclaw\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Z.ai：z.ai\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"start\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"智谱清言APP/网页版\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}},\"contentType_en\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_en\":null,\"content_en\":null,\"featured\":true,\"thumbnail_zh\":null,\"thumbnail_en\":null,\"active\":true,\"order\":0,\"tag_zh\":[\"基座模型\",\"Agent\"],\"tag_en\":[\"Agentic LLM\"],\"apiConfig_zh\":null,\"apiConfig_en\":null,\"experienceUrl_zh\":null,\"experienceUrl_en\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-21T04:54:19.553Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-03T10:29:20.932Z\"},\"externalurl_zh\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/zh/research/155\",\"externalurl_en\":\"https://www.zhipuai.cn/en/research/155\",\"title_zh\":\"GLM-5-Turbo\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-5-Turbo\",\"desc_zh\":\"专为龙虾场景打造的基座模型\",\"desc_en\":\"Built for Claw\",\"showNew\":false,\"active\":true,\"order\":3,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-22T06:37:19.934Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-19T12:45:35.934Z\"},{\"id\":3,\"link_type\":\"external\",\"article\":{\"id\":158,\"title_zh\":\"智谱联合华为开源国产芯片训练的多模态SOTA模型\",\"title_en\":\"GLM-Image: Auto-regressive for Dense-knowledge and High-fidelity  Image Generation\",\"createAt\":\"2026-01-13T16:00:00.000Z\",\"category\":\"blog\",\"resume_zh\":null,\"resume_en\":\"the first open-source, industrial-grade discrete auto-regressive image generation model\",\"contentType_zh\":\"content\",\"externalUrl_zh\":null,\"content_zh\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"今天，智谱联合华为开源新一代图像生成模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，模型基于昇腾Atlas 800T A2设备和昇思MindSpore AI框架完成从数据到训练的全流程，是\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在国产芯片上完成全程训练的SOTA多模态模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image采用自主创新的「自回归+扩散解码器」混合架构，实现了图像生成与语言模型的联合，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"是我们面向以Nano Banana Pro为代表的新一代「认知型生成」技术范式的一次重要探索\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"核心亮点如下：\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"架构革新，面向「认知型生成」的技术探索：采用创新的「自回归 + 扩散编码器」混合架构，兼顾全局指令理解与局部细节刻画，克服了海报、PPT、科普图等知识密集型场景生成难题，向探索以Nano Banana Pro为代表的新一代“知识+推理”的认知型生成模型迈出了重要一步。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"国产芯片完成全程训练的SOTA模型：模型自回归结构基座基于昇腾Atlas 800T A2设备与昇思MindSpore AI框架，完成了从数据预处理到大规模训练的全流程构建，验证了在国产全栈算力底座上训练前沿模型的可行性。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":3,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"文字渲染开源SOTA：在CVTG-2K（复杂视觉文本生成）和LongText-Bench（长文本渲染）榜单获得开源第一，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"尤其擅长汉字生成任务\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":4,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"高性价比与速度优化：API调用模式下，生成一张图片\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"仅需0.1元\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"，速度优化版本即将更新。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"架构创新：读懂指令，写对文字\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"近期，以\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Nano Banana Pro\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"为代表的闭源图像生成模型正在推动图像生成与大语言模型的深度融合。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"技术范式正从单一的图像生成，进化为兼具世界知识与推理能力的「认知型生成」\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。这些模型在海报、PPT、科普图等知识密集型场景及高保真细节呈现上表现惊艳，展现了这一技术范式的优势。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image正是我们面向「认知型生成」技术范式一次重要探索。这是开源的工业表现级离散自回归图像生成模型，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"我们希望借此与开源社区分享我们在这一前沿方向的技术路径与实践思考\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"创新架构让模型读懂写对：面对传统模型在“理解复杂指令”与“精准绘制文字”上难以兼顾的问题，GLM-Image 引入了「自回归+扩散解码器」混合架构，创新地融合了9B大小的自回归模型与7B大小的DiT扩散解码器。前者利用其语言模型的底座优势，专注于提升对指令的语义理解和画面的全局构图；后者配合Glyph Encoder的文本编码器，专注于还原图像的高频细节和文字笔画，以此改善模型“提笔忘字”的现象。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"多分辨率自适应：通过改进Tokenizer策略，GLM-Image能够自适应处理多种分辨率，原生支持从1024x1024到2048×2048尺寸的任意比例图像的生成任务，无需重新训练。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5af6adca8453370f68fbb\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":966,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:28:44.916Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:28:44.915Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/1-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"1-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":20036,\"width\":1080,\"height\":265,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"通用pipeline\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":2,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":2},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5af7cdca8453370f68fbc\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":967,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:28:59.459Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:28:59.459Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/2-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"2-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":24028,\"width\":1080,\"height\":411,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"解码器结构示意图\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":2,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":2},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"开源SOTA：更擅长文字密集生成任务\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"基于上述架构创新，GLM-Image在文字渲染的权威榜单中达到开源SOTA水平。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5af94dca8453370f68fbd\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":968,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:35:49.320Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:35:49.319Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/3-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"3-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":25520,\"width\":1080,\"height\":436,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"ul\",\"type\":\"list\",\"start\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":1,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"CVTG-2K（复杂视觉文字生成）\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"榜单核心考察模型在图像中同时生成多处文字的准确性。在多区域文字生成准确率上，GLM-Image凭借0.9116的Word Accuracy（文字准确率）成绩，位列开源模型第一。在NED（归一化编辑距离）指标上，GLM-Image同样以0.9557领先，表明其生成的文字与目标文字高度一致，错字、漏字情况更少。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textFormat\":1},{\"type\":\"listitem\",\"value\":2,\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"LongText-Bench（长文本渲染）榜单考察模型渲染长文本、多行文字的准确性，覆盖招牌、海报、PPT、对话框等8种文字密集场景，并分设中英双语测试，GLM-Image以英文0.952、中文0.979的成绩位列开源模型第一。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"listType\":\"bullet\",\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"国产芯片训练出的SOTA模型\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image是我们对国产计算生态的一次深度探索与验证。其自回归结构基座从早期的数据预处理到最终的大规模预训练，全流程均在昇腾Atlas 800T A2设备上完成。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"依托昇腾NPU和昇思MindSpore AI框架，使用动态图多级流水下发、高性能融合算子、多流并行等特性，我们自研了模型训练套件，全面优化数据预处理、预训练、SFT和RL的端到端流程。通过动态图的多级流水优化机制，将Host侧算子下发的关键阶段流水化并高度重叠，消除下发瓶颈；通过多流并行策略，通信和计算互掩，打破文本梯度同步、图像特征广播等操作的通信墙，极致优化性能；使用AdamW EMA、COC、RMS Norm等昇腾亲和的高性能融合算子，同步提升训练的稳定性和性能。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image是在国产芯片上完成全流程训练的SOTA多模态模型，\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"验证了在国产全栈算力底座上训练高性能多模态生成模型的可行性\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":1,\"version\":1},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"。我们希望这一实践能为社区挖掘国产算力潜力提供有价值的参考。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afafdca8453370f68fbe\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":969,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:36:23.915Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:36:23.915Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/4-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"4-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":40456,\"width\":1080,\"height\":471,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"tag\":\"h2\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"实测案例\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"让我们来看看GLM-Image在实际的复杂图文任务中的表现。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"场景一：科普插画\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image 更擅长绘制包含复杂逻辑流程与文字说明的科普插画及原理示意图。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afc2dca8453370f68fbf\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":970,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:01.387Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:01.386Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/5-2.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"5-2.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":97304,\"width\":1080,\"height\":684,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afcadca8453370f68fc0\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":971,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:15.244Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:15.243Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/6-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"6-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":107422,\"width\":1080,\"height\":684,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"场景二：多格图画\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"在生成电商图、漫画等多格图画时，GLM-Image能够保持风格和主体的一致性，并保障多处文字生成的准确率。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afd7dca8453370f68fc1\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":972,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:37.777Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:37:37.776Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/7-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"7-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":91728,\"width\":1080,\"height\":616,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"场景三：社交媒体图文封面\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image 适用于制作社交媒体封面及内容等排版复杂的图片，让您的创作更自由丰富。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afe5dca8453370f68fc2\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":973,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:02.547Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:02.546Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/8-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"8-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":135654,\"width\":1080,\"height\":1461,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5afeddca8453370f68fc3\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":974,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:16.338Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:16.338Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/9-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"9-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":118032,\"width\":1080,\"height\":1461,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"id\":\"69e5aff8dca8453370f68fc4\",\"type\":\"upload\",\"value\":{\"id\":975,\"alt\":\" \",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:32.039Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-20T04:38:32.038Z\",\"url\":\"/api/media/file/10-1.webp\",\"thumbnailURL\":null,\"filename\":\"10-1.webp\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\",\"filesize\":135450,\"width\":1080,\"height\":1445,\"focalX\":50,\"focalY\":50},\"fields\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"version\":3,\"relationTo\":\"media\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"场景四：商业海报\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"GLM-Image 能够生成构图富有设计感、文字嵌入准确的节日海报与商业宣传图。\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"justify\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"chi